<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai; nachenganchepaw risi Samuel naown kown mih sakowmra uowi. Now arui khin dow 1,000-900 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih auown khe dow 1 Samuel bowih hown abowih sang chowdiah. Tawkche akung kowi nami dow changah pre buk khai. Mami bowih dow 1 Samuel bowih kowi kowh laiklow chawn chekhai. Mami bowih kowi arui lang uowi mih dow mang David chownglawng lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">CHAKRAMANG kloah kung kowi David mih ahuma cham awng tasen khai, now Israeluüa luk kowi chowm mang khai. Jerusalem marow dow aia thawpah mih marow kri chekhai. Nami marow kowi dow aia mih thawp mang kim lowk khai, now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla paw nakowi aia towah khai. David kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih chowngchowng saksakma aia kowh krungchakuüa naka mang rah kownkow khamah khai. Tawkche akung kowi aia chang ngak rakowi aia kowi mih CHAKRAMANG kunmarauah khai. Angak rakowi aia kimchakuüa dow taset plawt khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">2 Samuel bowih kowi kowh David chownglawng hownia tasangra uowi mih dow Thurai kowi owmsakra hownia ka kür mih hai Lai üara hownia phih uang ting reng pami chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Singku huamang: Singku huamang pami dow hua aiukma hai akhi akhawtma mih kowi tek pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Pawitang: Pawitang pami dow singh hown kowh thawpah mih prowng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Awmrawm sung: Awmrawm sung pami dow lowra lup chang kowi awng khe awmrawm kowh maru pe mih uanh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Ana pek: Ana pek pami dow achün takla ngengche mih laiklow chekhai. Ana pek laiklow dow chün dowi now ripra uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Judauüa luk kowi David chowm mang mih 1:1-4:12</para>
  <para style="io1">Israeluüa maten luk kowi David chowm mang mih 5:1-24:25</para>
  <para style="io2">Uown chowm mang mih 5:1-10:19</para>
  <para style="io2">David hai Betseba 11:1-12:25</para>
  <para style="io2">Piakra uang ting mih 12:26-20:26</para>
  <para style="io2">David kowh mangra chur pra kowh ni 21:1-24:25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Sawl hai Jonathan iüah kowng mih satang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Sawl kowng kung kowi David mih Amalekuüa kowi senah now nowngta khai, now Ziklak marow kowi aia uang plan hanow uowila pre ni khai. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Now sum ni mih ni khe dow Sawl siphai hawmh kowh tangbung khup rah hownia David tut-e klanguüa uang lowk ia khai. Nami klanguüa dow aia uowila uiting uangtak rakowi thekna theknama mih tawnguat uang khupla khai, now lu kowi paw uang pruila dinchow khai. Aia dow David tut-e uangah hanow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se uang chupah khai.<verse eid="2SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Nami klanguüa kowi David lüntaah mih, “Tawng hownia chow en uang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Nami klanguüa klangah mih, “Israeluüa kowh tangbung khupra hownia ang uang powt mih chowbowt!” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />David plan lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow own? Tek ang madiah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Nami klanguüa klangah mih, “Tasenra hownia maru kawmuüa powt bowk khowk. Now kowng paw kowng ne khowk. Sawl hai Jonathan iüah pachowh paw kowng khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Nami klanguüa kowi David plan lüntaah mih, “Saul hai Jonathan iüah kowng khowk pami tawng iawng chow en tukah khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Nami klanguüa klangah mih, “Nakhowk khe ang mih Gilboa hungh kowi chekhai. Nami khin khe Sawl mih reh hown tathawkla se iowng phülü chowdiah. Nakhowk khe kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih ransu-uüa aia re-e uang ting kown mih atawnchow towbowt chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Nami khin khe Sawl dow krawi tang mü hanow khita ang khai, now uai haw ang khai. Nakhowk khe ang tek pe mih, ‘Tawng chow chakramang?’ ang pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />“Aia lünta ang mih, ‘Mia chow en?’ pah ang khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">“Ang klangah mih, ‘Ang dow Amalekuüa chowtaih,’ ang pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />“Aia tek mih, ‘Sakrauma hown ang re-e uang hanow uang saita ang bowt. Ang ngare lai bowt; kowng kown towbowt ang nau,’ pah ang khai.<verse eid="2SA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />“Naiawng rakowi ang kowkowiah now aia kowi mih ang kowsaita khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow sing dowi bowt tham pami ang tuk chekhai. Now aia kowh mang lukruk hai kuaiseh dow ang klüpta pe khai. Naiawngün dow ang kowh chakramang en tut-e ang uang pawla en khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Nami laiklow tata hanow David hai aia tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih siphai maten amatni kowh tawnguat thekah büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Amatni dow tawngpaw cha büah kham büah dowi kowi sat kup dowi mowr kar büah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow Sawl hai Jonathan iüah pachowh vüi hai tasenra kowi kowh cham kowng mih CHAKRAMANG kowh siphai hawmh Israeluüa vüi uowila uiting uangtak büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Nami uang phowng satang mih klanguüa kowi David lüntaah mih, “En dow tawng hownia kowh maru chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Nami klanguüa klangah mih, “Ang dow mami Israel pren kowi kowh tawi uowi mih Amalekuüa taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />David tek pe aia mih, “CHAKRAMANG nümnapah mih maru kowi nasaita kown mih tawngplawng kowchow mapaw en kram dowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Now David dow aia kowh maru kowi hawah lowk ia now tek pe mih, “Uangah now mami maru kowi uang sai madiah!” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi David kowh maru dow nami klanguüa kowi saita khai. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Now David tek mih, “En kowng mih aprek dow en chowtaih nakur kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG nümnapah mih maru kowi en saita mih en matia nawr hown en taphuang khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowh kar meng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Mami kar meng dow Sawl hai Jonathan iüah pachowh vüi kowi kowh David tekah mih chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Mami meng kowi dow Salangba Meng pahai chap pe ming khai. Mami kar meng mih Juda krungchakuüa maten kowi nakrawi sangah kown mih David peah ana khai. Mami meng dow Jaser Bowih pami kowi arui uowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />Aw Israel, en kowh kiowrira, en kowh aluchowuüa dow hungh luk kowi kowng khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">en kowh tasen kiakma miuüa dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Nami satang dow Gat marowchakuüa kowi hangkow phowng pe büah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">Askelawn marow kowi kowh tiama kowi hangkow phuangla büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">Enni phuangla now Filistin masiuüa hawmh naawmrawm kown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">now tuk Thurai dowi miuüa kowh chamauüa napiaw kown chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />Gilboa hungma mawngmauüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">
    <char style="w">nang</char> tui lah, uang lah enni luk kowi hang pacham kla lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">nakowi kowh süng kowi dow luprak hang pacham phaw lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tasen kiakma miuüa kowh <char style="w">kawngma</char> ringkawra piak mih dow nakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">Sawl kowh kawngma kowi dow sau hown nasawkah kown nadowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Jonathan kowh salangba dow krawi paw maru sak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">Sawl kowh saidawng dow krawi sai maru reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">Amatchi dow ransu-uüa kowh vi krawi hawk pe reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">amatchi dow tasen kiakma miuüa kowh buk krawi sawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Sing uowi reng tak khe Sawl hai Jonathan iüah kowi dow lainowmma maru sakrauah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">kowng khe paw amatchi dow alangma nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Amatchi dow uamu iowk lak-e iowm lang len,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">now krangsi lak-e paw lang kür iüah chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Israel masiuüa low, Sawl vüi kowi kar büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">aia dow asung khakma mih uan aringma mih pe khup enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">dan pe kuh mih uan klangiungma mih hown tawng enni khai.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Tasen kiakma miuüa dow tasenra kowi kowng khai bowt!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Jonathan kowh uak dow hungh luk kowi takuak hüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Aw ang tainau Jonathan, en rakowi lainowmma ang sak nga khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">ang dow lainowmma sakrau en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">En kowh sakraura dow ang tut-e asung uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">Nami dow masiuüa kowi kowh sakrau mih lak-e lang pankri chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />Tasen kiakma miuüa dow tasenra kowi kowng khai bowt!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Amatni kowh saidawng hai reh ün paw hing piak khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Juda krungchakuüa luk kowi David uown chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi David lüntaah mih, “Juda krungchakuüa kowh lowra mih marow kowi ang kowkowi kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ow, kowkowi bowt,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Now David lüntaah mih, “Tawng mih marow kowi chow ang kowkowi kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Hebrawn marow kowi kowkowi bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Nahanow David dow aia kowh masi Ahinoam hai Abigail iüah kowi pawla now Hebrawn marow kowi kowkowi khai. Ahinoam dow Jezrel chenchap chekhai, now Abigail dow Karmel chenchap kowng mih Nabal kowh masi chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Now aia tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih maru-uüa maten kowi dow kimchakuüa hailawm David pawla khai. Amatni dow Hebrawn marow riaret kowi kowh kua kowi krawi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Nami khin khe Juda maru-uüa dow Hebrawn marow kowi uang büah khai. Now David kowi dow Juda krungchakuüa luk kowi nape chowmah mang kownkow nümnapah büah khai. Now David kowi tek pe büah mih, “Saul kowh uak dup miuüa dow Jabes-Gilead kowi kowh maru-uüa chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />Nakhowk khe aia dow Jabes-Gileaduüa tut-e kowchin maru khai. Now aia krawi tek pe mih, “Enni kowh chakramang Sawl kowi enni dup mih dow aia luk kowi kaah sakowm mih lup enni chang mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih enni luk kowi pacham pe enni prasi lah. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowmma mih rah pacham tüng enni lah. Now enni kowh nami lup rakowi ang paw aiungma naklowp naklang enni kown. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Enni kowh mang Sawl dow kowng khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowi büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow Juda krungchakuüa dow nümnapta ang khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel mang Isboset</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Nachenganchepaw Ner kowh chapa Abner dow Sawl kowh chapa Isboset kowi mih Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Mahanaim pami arah kowi kowpawla khai. Abner dow Sawl kowh siphai aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Now aia dow Isboset kowi mih Israeluüa maten luk kowi pe chowmah mang khai. Now Israeluüa nimkrüa kowi dow Gileaduüa, Asuruüa, Jezreluüa, Efraimuüa, Benjaminuüa hai akeng mih chenchapuüa paw tawi uowi chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Sawl kowh chapa Isboset dow 40 ning khe Israeluüa luk kowi chowm mang khai, now aia dow pre ning mowr chowmla mang khai. Nachenganchepaw Juda krungchakuüa dow David nimkrüa kowi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />David mih Hebrawn marow hownia Juda krungchakuüa luk kowi ranit ning hown dawnglang mowr chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa hown Judauüa tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Akat khe Ner kowh chapa Abner mih Sawl kowh chapa Isboset kowh maru-uüa kowi pawla now Mahanaim hownia Gibeawn marow kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Nami khin khe Zerui kowh chapa Joab hai David kowh maru-uüa mih amatni hown nauang takrum kownkow uang tarü khai. Now nami pre thumchak maru-uüa dow Gibeawn kowi kowh kanh re-e uang takrum büah khai. Pathum mih maru-uüa dow kanh mapra pown kowi chowm khai, now alowk mih thumchakuüa dow kanh paipra pown kowi chowm khai.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Nakhowk khe Abner tek pe Joab mih, “Pre thumchak hownia klanguüa pacham rü pre sum ia lah, now amatni mih a-i pur kowi saidawng hown pacham tadowk takhüm lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Joab klangah mih, “En tek iawng phaw kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Now nape tadowkah takhüm kownkow Benjamin krungchak hai Sawl kowh chapa Isboset maru-uüa hownia 12 ia, now David kowh maru-uüa hownia 12 ia kloah büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Nakhowk khe pre thumchak maru-uüa mih lowkkowlowk lu tadowk hanow betmaram kowi saichow hown tasawt büah khai, now amatni dow akrowksang taiua kowng büah bowk khai. Naiawng rakowi Gibeawn kowi kowh nami arah ming dow Helkat-Hazurim pahai chap pe khai. (Helkat-Hazurim pami dow “Saidawng dowm” pami chekhai).<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Nami ni khe amatni dow lainowmma tasen büah khai, now Abner hai Israeluüa dow David kowh maru-uüa tut-e sum khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Nami tasenra kowi dow Zerui kowh chapa Joab, Abisai hai Asahel büah paw tawi uowi sum ia chekhai. Asahel dow kaurawng naki iawng iowm lenma chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Aia dow Abner kowi kawikrawiah khai. Nami khin khe aia dow hawmlawm lakuai prakowi ngeu dowi chekhai; aia dow atengma Abner kowi kawikrawi khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Now Abner dow iu dang now Asahel kowi tek pe mih, “En chowbowt bow Asahel?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Asahel tek pe mih, “Ow, ang chowbowt Asahel,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Nakhowk khe Abner tek pe aia mih, “Hawmlawm lakuai prakowi krawi tang mü diah, now mami klanguüa hawmh hownia khümah lowk ia now aia kowh tasen tawnguat pawta pe diah,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Asahel dow aia kung kawikrawi rengreng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Asahel kowi Abner plan tek pe mih, “Iowng diah, hauang kawikrawi ang tham bowt. Sai en kown ang nau dowi. Ang che saita en hanow en taimow Joab tut-e ang kowh lumowr tawng iawng chow ang natüngah kown?” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Nachenganchepaw Asahel dow plan kown mih nauta dowi chekhai. Nakhowk khe Abner dow aia kowh reh iu howkah now reh pung hown Asahel mu kowi haisawtah khai, now nami reh pung dow Asahel kumlawng hownia uang towk plaik khai. Nahanow Asahel dow nami re-e tim now hing kowng khai. Asahel kowngra re-e kowh uang ting mih maru maten dow nami re-e iowng hüah khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Nachenganchepaw Joab hai Abisai iüah dow Abner kowi kawikrawi rengreng tak chekhai. Now Amma hungh re-e uang ting iüah khe dow sat kup khai bowt. Nami Amma hungh uowi rah dow Gibeawn kowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma prakowi mangla mih tiama re-e kowh Giah pami arah hown tatingtang klowk chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Benjamin krungchakuüa dow Abner tut-e uang takua talawm khai iawk, now amatni dow pathum sang hungh luk kowi kowiowng büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Nakhowk khe Abner tek pe Joab mih, “Chowngchowng saksakma saidawng hown a-i natasai reng kown bow? Achur kowi angak chowtaih naphaw kown mih en tuk dowi bow? En tainau-uüa kowi nakawikrawi dowi bowt kown mih tawng khe tak chow en maru-uüa kowi en napeah ana kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Abner kowi Joab klangah mih, “Masing Thurai ming hown ang takham khowk, en tek dowi e dow maru-uüa mih amatni kowh tainau-uüa kowi tharau rau-e mowr kawikrawi kown tak chowdiah,” pape khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Naiawng tek hanow aia dow nataingta tasen kownkow tum baw khai. Nahanow maru kawmuüa dow taingta tasen khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Now Abner hai aia maru-uüa dow uar prowt Araba lawngrawi iawng mang büah hanow Jawrdan aw haipown büah khai, now Mahanaim kowi kowtowm büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Joab dow Abner kung kawikrawi mih towta hanow kim prakowi plan khai bowt. Now aia dow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi arasang kuaah khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow Asahel hai David kowh maru 19 iachow taih tawi taküm dowi mih aia tuk khai. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Tawkche Abner kowh maru-uüa kowi David kowh maru-uüa saita pe mih dow 360 ia chekhai. Naiawngün kowng miuüa dow Benjamin krungchak kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Amatni dow Asahel kowh uak mih kawtla büah hanow Bethlehem marow kowi kowpawla khai, now aia kowi dow a-pa tadupra kowi kowdupah büah khai. Nami kung kowi Joab hai aia maru-uüa dow uar prowt mang büah hanow Hebrawn marow kowi rau-e kowtowm büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Sawl kowh siphai hawmh hai David kowh siphai hawmh dow tasen mih akrama khowk chekhai. David thumchak dow uang lang kür ngamlam khai. Nachenganchepaw Sawl thumchak dow kür uang iaw ngamlam chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowh chapauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Maiawngün dow Hebrawn kowi uowi reng tak khe kowh David kaah mih chapauüa chekhai. Aia kowh chapa ta dow Amnawn chekhai. Amnawn kowh u dow Jezrel marow hownia kowh Ahinoam chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Amnawn dak kowi kowh dow Kileab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kileab </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami ming 1Krungchakuüa 3:1 kowi dow Daniel pahai arui uowi chekhai.</char></note> chekhai. Kileab kowh u dow Karmel marowchak kowng mih Nabal kowh masi Abigail chekhai. Kileab dak kowi kowh dow Absalawm chekhai. Absalawm u dow Gesur pren kowi kowh mang Talmai chama Maka chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Absalawm dak kowi kowh dow Adonija chekhai. Adonija kowh u dow Hagit chekhai. Adonija dak kowi kowh dow Sefatia chekhai. Sefatia kowh u dow Abital chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />Sefatia dak kowi kowh dow Ithream chekhai. Ithream kowh u dow Egla chekhai. Naiawngün taruk ia mih chapauüa dow Hebrawn marow kowi uowi reng tak khe kowh David kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">David tut-e Abner uang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Sawl kowh siphai hawmh hai David kowh siphai hawmh tasen thüm khe Sawl kowh siphai hawmh pungmadawng hownia Abner mih uang kür ngamlam khai. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sawl kowh dow Rizpa pami aia changla masi mih narma uowi lowk ia. Rizpa dow Aiah kowh chama chekhai. Akat khe Isboset tek pe Abner mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow apa <char style="w">changla masi mih narma</char> hown en tuk taphua taiua khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Isboset kowh laiklow tata hanow Abner dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. Aia tek pe mih, “Judauüa kung krawi mih kui bow ang? Ani mowr kowi en pa Sawl kowh kimchak, tasin taken miuüa hai auiuauüa luk kowi kaah sakowmma ang uowi reng tak. Now en kowi paw David rut kowi ang ap en dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw nami masiuüa lawnguan kowi en pe ang angak khai! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9-10" />David tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG takhamta mih nauang tachi kownkow ang nachang pe kown. Ang che chang pe dowi hanow Thurai mih akraingma pacham rip ang lah. Sawl kowh mang chowm rah dow David kowi ang naap pe kown. Now David dow Israel hai Juda krungchakuüa luk kowi Dan marow hownia Ber-Seba marow mowr nachowm mang kown,” pape khai. <verse eid="2SA 3:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Isboset dow Abner kowi anawrchow paw klangah dowi bowt chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow Abner kowi lainowmma kramah khai.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Nami kung kowi dow Abner mih aiamat takcha kowi David tut-e kowchin maru khai. Now krawi tek pe mih, “Mami pren en kowh nadowi bow? Ang hown tatow sangbowk laitawm diah. Nahanow Israeluüa maten natawi tangila en kownkow ang natawi khowng en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />David tek pe mih, “En tek mih iung chow. En hown ang tatow sangbowk laitawm kown taih. Tawkchedow en nachang ang lup lowk kown takla. Ang tut-e en plan uang mih khin khe Sawl kowh chama Mikal kowi en nauang pawla ngengche kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih Sawl kowh chapa Isboset tut-e kowchin maru khai. Now aia krawi tek pe mih, “Ang kowh masi Mikal kowi peta ang bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow 100 ia Filistinuüa kowh khampha uanpik hown ang the pe buk sung mih chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Naiawng rakowi Isboset ana pek iawng Mikal kowi mih ahua Paltiel kim hownia uang pawla khai bowt. Paltiel dow Lais kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Paltiel dow karla se Behurim marow mowr amasi kung uang tawi krawi khai. Nakhowk khe Abner tek pe aia mih, “Kim kowi kowplan bowt!” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow kim kowi kowplan khai.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Nami dowi rawn khe Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi Abner tek pe mih, “Makha hownia David kowi nape chowmah mang kown mih enni nau bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow nami iawng chang büah bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Filistinuüa rut hownia hai amatni kowh ransu-uüa rut hownia Israeluüa kowi aia kowh nar David nalawngah kown mih CHAKRAMANG rik tekta khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abner dow Benjaminuüa kowi paw nami lawnguan kowtekla pe khai. Now nami lawnguan kowi Israeluüa hai Benjaminuüa tawi nauta mih David kowi nakowtek pe kownkow Hebrawn marow kowi aia kowkowi khai.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abner dow pawla maru 20 ia now David uowi rah Hebrawn kowi kowkowi khai. Nakowi kowtowm mih khin khe David mih Abner hai aia kowh maru-uüa vüi hawt thak pawi lowk khai. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Nami kung kowi Abner tek pe David mih, “Ang kowh mangkri, en tut-e Israeluüa nauang takua talawm kownkow ang kowmang tak ba. Nahanow amatni dow en hown natatow sangbowk laitawm kown, now amatni luk kowi mih en nau iawng en naia chowm mang kown,” pakhai. Nahanow Abner kowi mih thaulangma David pe mangah khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abner kowi Joab saita mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Abner kowi thaulangma David pe mangta klowpchow kung kowi David kowh maru-uüa hai Joab mih uang mang tasen khai. Amatni dow tasenra hownia ahuma uang pawla uanh büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Joab hai aia kowh siphaiuüa uang ting mih khin khe maru kawmuüa hawt tek pe Joab mih, “Ner kowh chapa Abner mih mang tut-e uang chowdiah. Aia kowi dow athaulangma mang David pe mangta khai bowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Nakhowk khe Joab dow mang tut-e kowkowiah hanow tek pe mih, “Tawng chow naiawng en tuk chang khai? Abner dow en tut-e uang khowk pache tawngplawng kowchow aia kowi en tuk pe mangta khai? Aia dow alakma kowi cham ting bowt ni! <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Ner kowh chapa Abner kowi dow en aiawng tuk towbowt. Aia dow nauang kuan en kownkow en tut-e uang mih chekhai. Tawng ngai chow en chang kown mih hai tawng kowi ngai chow en cham kowi kown mih natuk kownkow aia uang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Naiawng tekla hanow Joab mih David hownia lawt khai, now Abner kowi nakrawi khüm kownkow aia mih kowkrawi chin maru khai. Nami maru-uüa dow Sira pami tuikuam hownia Abner kowi uang khümla büah khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün lawnguan mih David tawi tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Now Hebrawn kowi Abner uang ting khowk hanow Joab dow tek pe laisin kown mih powm iawng marow tapplawt re-e Abner kowi cham pawla khai. Now Joab mih Abner mu kowi sawtah now kowngta khai. Naiawng hai Joab dow atainau Asahel kowh lu klai pawah khai.<verse eid="2SA 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28-30" />Gibeawn pami arah kowi tasen khe Abner dow Asahel kowi kowngta khai. Naiawng rakowi Asahel kowh tainau Joab hai Abisai iüah Abner kowi saita mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:28-30">Akung kowi dow David mih nami satang tawi ta khai. Now aia tek mih, “Ner kowh chapa Abner kowng mih lawnguan kowi ang hai ang maru-uüa mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi chowngchowng saksakma aprek uowi dowi chekhai. Nami saita mih aprek dow Joab hai aia kowh krungchakuüa maten pacham ka lah. Aia kowh krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi tawngbak mih dow khampha uanh hownia aiawnglowma tui awr towk naklak mih rawka naphaw kown, tawngbak mih dow pik rawka ngak naphaw kown, tawngbak mih dow raitua hown amang natakla kown, tawngbak mih kowi dow maru nasaiah kown, now tawngbak mih dow akhawr hown nangare kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 3:28-30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abner vüi David tek kar meng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Nami kung kowi Joab hai aia kowh maru-uüa kowi David tek pe mih, “Enni khupah mih tawnguat thekta büah now khup sala uan büa diah. Now Abner vüi kowi uowila uiting uangtak büa diah,” pakhai. Kawtla uak miuüa kung kowi David paw tawi ta mang khai. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Abner kowi dow Hebrawn marow kowi dupah büah khai. Abner tadupra re-e mang David mih atün atünma kar khai, now maru kawmuüa paw tawi kar bowk khai. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Mami kar meng dow Abner vüi kowi kowh David tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Abualama mih maru iawng tawngplawng kowchow Abner tuk kowng khai?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />En kowh rut dow atawmma nadowi chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">en kowh khawk kowi paw lawngha leng uowi dowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa rut kowi kowh kowng mih maru iawng en kowng khai!” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Nami tata hanow maru kawmuüa mih Abner vüi plan kar khai iawk. <verse eid="2SA 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Sat kup dowi tak khe nacha nakham kownkow maru kawmuüa mih David kowi uang tek pe rengreng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow tawngpaw cha kown nau dowi chekhai. Aia dow kham sawi se tek mih, “Sat kup dowi rawn kawm lah, akeng mih chakkham lah tawngpaw ang cha kown nadowi. Ang che cha khai hanow CHAKRAMANG mih akraingma pacham rip ang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Naiawng David chang mih khi hanow maru kawmuüa dow awmrawm khai. Lainowm che tek now nami khin khe kowh maru kawmuüa dow mang changah mih srui kowi lainowmma tawi sak-ih reng chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Ner kowh chapa Abner kowng mih kowi David dow tawi talük takak dowi chekhai. Nami lawnguan dow maru-uüa maten hai Israeluüa maten mih nami ni kowi tuk büah khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Now aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi mang David tek pe mih, “Ani Israel pren kowi kowh lang kri mih aluchow kowng lowk ia mih enni tuk dowi bow? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG nümnapah mih mang chepaw kawmat mih ang kowh kür uowi dowi chekhai. Zerui kowh chapa Joab hai Abisai iüah kowi dow ang ia kruitown dowi chekhai. CHAKRAMANG dow amatchi kowh lup ngak sung pacham peah lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Isboset kowi saita mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Hebrawn marow kowi Abner kowng mih satang dow Sawl kowh chapa Isboset mih tawi ta khai. Nami satang tata hanow aia dow mapaw ka sakowmra dowi bowt chekhai, now Israeluüa maten paw lainowmma kram khai. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Isboset kowh dow siphai aluchow uowi pre ia. Lowk ia mih ming dow Bana, now alowk mih ming dow Rekab chekhai. Amatchi dow Benjamin krungchak Rimawn kowh chapa chekhai. Rimawn uowi mih dow Berawt marow kowi chekhai. Berawt marow dow Benjaminuüa kowh süng kowi tawi taphang khai. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Berawt marowchakuüa dow Gitaim marow kowi kowpowt hanow nakowi kowhing uowi khai; kawmat paw prenlang maru iawng hai nakowi uowi büah reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Sawl chapa Jonathan kowh dow chapa uowi lowk ia. Aming dow Mefiboset chekhai. Aia tanga ningchow reng tak khe tasenra kowi a-pa Jonathan hai a-pu Sawl iüah kowng mih satang Jezrel marow hownia maru uang phowng pe khai. Nami satang tata hanow aia kowi kowh mingkhet miia dow aia kowi paila now alenma cham powtla khai. Naiawng cham powtla mih khin khe mingkhet miia dow Mefiboset kowi dowta dup khai. Naiawng rakowi nami hownia aia kowh dow klowng hing tabai khai.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Akat khe Rekab hai Bana iüah dow ni ür thüm khe Isboset kim kowi kowkowi khai. Nami khin dow Isboset kowh tanai khin chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6-8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6-8" />Nami khin khe kimplawt kowi kowh hawt krap püm mih masiuüa dow amüi khai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi dow maru tuk dowi iawng kim lak kowi kownowng kup khai. Now Isboset kowh müi rah towklak kowi kowkup iüah khai. Nakhowk khe Isboset dow sawlawnma kowi hawt amüi khai. Now Isboset mu kowi sawtah hanow kowngta iüah khai. Nami kung kowi dungta pe alu hanow pawla iüah khai. Now Araba pra kowh mangla mih tiama iawng uar prowt mang iüah khai, now amatchi dow nami lu mih Hebrawn marow kowi David tut-e kowpawla iüah khai. Amatchi uang tek pe mih, “Mow, en kowh ransu Sawl kowh chapa Isboset kowh lu! Sawl dow nasai en kown mih sangkrang reng chekhai. Ang kowh mangkri en vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG dow ani mih Sawl hai achapa luk kowi paw pe lu klai khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 4:6-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Nachenganchepaw Rekab hai Bana iüah kowi David tek pe mih, “Phih maiow hownia kowh lawng ang mih masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang tek khowk. <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />Maru lowk ia dow Sawl kowng mih ang vüi kowi satang iung pah ka tuak kowh uang phowng ang khai. Nami rakowi aia dow ang napeah awmrawm sung kown padow ka tuak khai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow Ziklak marow kowi ang saita khai. Nami dow aia kowh awmrawm sung chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Nachenganchepaw enchi ngam dow angak uowi dowi mih maru kowi aiamat kim kowi kowkowiah hanow sawlawnma luk kowi enchi kowsaiah khai! Enchi iawng mih maru ngakuüa kowi ngam dow lainowmma ang narip enchi kown! Enchi kowngta mih maru kowh lu klai dow ang napaw enchi kown, now lusa hownia ang namata enchi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Now Rekab hai Bana iüah kowi nasaita kownkow David mih aia maru-uüa kowi peah ana khai. Now amatni dow kowiüah kowi saita khai. Amatchi kowh rut khawk dow dungta pe büah khai, now abuk dow Hebrawn marow kowi kowh kanh ria kowi tarta hüah khai. Nachenganchepaw Isboset kowh lu dow Hebrawn marow kowi kowh Abner tadupra kowi kowdupah büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa maten luk kowi David chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Nami kung kowi Israel krungchakuüa kowh aluchowuüa maten dow Hebrawn marow kowi David tut-e uang khai. Now amatni tek pe mih, “A-i dow pabuk panga chak maru chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Sawl chowm mang reng tak khe paw Israel siphaiuüa tasenra kowi en chowtaih kruitown a-i reng. Now CHAKRAMANG tek en mih, ‘Ang maru Israeluüa kowi ruapur thing iawng en naming nakhetah kown. Now amatni kowh aluchow en nachowng kown,’ pakhai,” pape büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Naiawng David tut-e Hebrawn marow kowi lawngtang aluchowuüa uang mih khin khe mang David dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi amatni hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. Now amatni dow amatni Israeluüa luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow David kowi nümnapah büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Aia chowm mang mih khin khe David dow 30 ning khowk chekhai. Aia dow Israeluüa kowi 40 ning mowr kruitownla khai. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Aia dow Hebrawn marow kowi kowh Judauüa kowi ranit ning hown dawnglang mowr kruitownla khai. Now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Israeluüa maten hai Judauüa kowi dow 33 ning mowr aia kruitownla khai.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow David powngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Akat khe David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa mih Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Jebusuüa kowi kowsenah kownkow kowtarü khai. Now Jebusuüa dow amatni kowi David nowngah dowi tham padow ka tuak khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni tek pe David mih, “Makowi enni uang nowng kup kown nadowi! Enni kowi taih now mikdu miuüa hai klowng khawn tabai miuüa khowm padow lawk prüt enni dowi!” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Nachenganchepaw Zaiawn kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim dow David powngta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi akung kowi Zaiawn kowi dow David marow pahai maru chap pe ming khai.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Nami ni khe David tek mih, “Mikdu miuüa hai klowng khawn tabai miuüa khowm padow nanowngta a-i kown pahai tek mih Jebusuüa kowi lainowmma ang sui. Amatni kowi kowsen kown nau mih dow tui hawr reng mih puk iawng nakowkowi kown takla,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi maru-uüa tek mih, “Mikdu miuüa hai klowng khawn tabai miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi ia kup kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih nami akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi kowuowi khai, now nami dow David marow pahai chap pe ming khai. Now marow satlawt pra kowh arema mih kowi thia pe bawn mih hownia kangchawngra kimkrowng tapat lut mowr David mih thawp marow khai. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />David dow uang lang kür ngamlam khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai dow aia tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Akat khe Tura marow mang Hiram mih David tut-e uang chin maru pre sum ia khai, now sidar singh paw uang krawi sa pe khai. Naiawngünuüa hown dow singh hai hua hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa kowi paw uang krawi chin pe khai. Now amatni mih David vüi uang chang pe kim khai. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Nahanow aia kowi dow Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG pe chowmah mang mih chowbowt pami David tatuk khai. Now David kowh mang chowm rah CHAKRAMANG pe iukah mih paw CHAKRAMANG aia kowh maru Israeluüa vüi kowi chekhai pami David tuk khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih Hebrawn hownia lawt hanow Jerusalem marow kowi kowuowi khai. Now aia dow nakowi paw kowplan paw masi khai iawk, now changla masi mih nar paw kowplan paw khai iawk. Aia dow naiawngün masi hown paw kowplan ka chauüa khai iawk. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Jerusalem marow kowi uowi reng tak khe kowh aia kaah mih chauüa dow Samua, Sobab, Nathan, Sawlawmawn, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibar, Elisua, Nefek, Japhiha, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elisama, Eliada hai Elifelet büah chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowi David nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Israeluüa mih amatni luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow David kowi nümnapta khowk pami satang Filistinuüa tawi ta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow siphaiuüa maten kowi pawla now David kowi nakrawi sen kownkow krawi cham büah khai. Nachenganchepaw Filistinuüa uang krawi chamah mih satang David tata khai. Naiawng rakowi David dow akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi kowdowm khai. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Filistinuüa dow Refaim lawngrawi kowi uang towm hanow cham krawi taset büah plawt khai. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi David lüntaah mih, “Filistinuüa kowi ang kowsenah kown bow? Amatni kowi ang rut kowi en naap ang kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “Ow, kowsen bowt. Amatni kowi mih en rut kowi ang naap en ngengche kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Nahanow David dow Filistinuüa uowi rah kowi kowkowi khai, now nakowi mih Filistinuüa kowi aia nowngta khai. Nakhowk khe aia tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow tui lawt khe kowh tui akürma mih iawng ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi piakah khai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow Baal-Perazim pahai chapah khai. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Nami arah kowi dow Filistinuüa mih amatni kowh thuraiuüa rup ta towla hüah khai. Now naiawngün dow David hai aia kowh maru-uüa mih pawla khai.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Nachenganchepaw akung kowi Filistinuüa mih Refaim kowi plan uang hanow krawi taset plawt büah khai iawk. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Nami khin khe paw David mih CHAKRAMANG kowi plan lüntaah khai iawk. Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Purdowng hownia hangkow sen diah. Amatni kung iawng kowkowi now ‘Balsam’ singh rüm hownia senah diah. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Balsam singh plawng kowi dow siphai mang tün iawng en nata kown. Naiawng en ta hown krowksang amatni kowi en nasenah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Filistin siphai hawmh kowi nasenah kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow en pur kowi rik mang mih chowbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />David dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng chang khai. Aia dow Geba marow hownia Gezer marow mowr patiama rawng Filistinuüa kowi kawikrawiah hanow saiah khai.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi kowpawla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Akung kowi dow David mih Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang kloah mih maru iun 30,000 ia kowi plan kuaah khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Now David hai aia kowh maru maten dow Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Jerusalem marow kowi nauang pawla kownkow Bala-Juda marow kowi kowkowi khai. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowi dow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG uowi pahai maru tukah chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm luk kowi kowh Cherup rup pre buk mih takra kowi dow CHAKRAMANG uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Amatni dow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih hungh kowi kowh Abinadab kim hownia uang lawtla now chia kari sar kowi tangah büah khai. Now nami chia kari dow Abinadab kowh chapa Uza hai Ahiaw iüah kowi pe pawla büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />Uza dow nami chia kari ria kowi krawi takhep rowtrowt se krawi mang khai, now Ahiaw dow nami chia kari pur kowi rik mang khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />David hai aia kowh maru maten dow meng hown, plai hown, atün ateu hown CHAKRAMANG pur kowi piaw büah khai. Amatni dow taraw hown, tingteng hown, sawkchow hai klingchow hown piaw büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Nachenganchepaw Nakawn kowh cha thuara re-e uang ting büah khe küngla kari mih chiala pre pum trui mih tatheu khai. Nakhowk khe Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nadowh pakowh Uza mih haidowkta khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Naiawng sangbowk laitawm tawkpla awr dowkta khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Uza kowi lainowmma kunmarauah khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pawta pe asak khai. Nahanow Uza dow Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla ria re-e hing kowng khai.<verse eid="2SA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Naiawng Uza kowi CHAKRAMANG pawta pe asak khai rakowi David dow kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow Perez-Uza pahai aia chap pe khai. (Perez-Uza pami dow “Uza kowh piakra” pami chekhai). Nami arah ming dow kawmat paw Perez-Uza chowreng tak chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Nami ni khe David dow CHAKRAMANG kowi lainowmma kramah khai. Aia tek mih, “Tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla ang tut-e ang uang ia pawla kown chow?” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Naiawng rakowi David dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Jerusalem marow kowi kowpawla kown mih nauta dowi chekhai. Now aia dow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Gat marow kowi kowh Obed-Edawm kim kowi kowtowla khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Now Obed-Edawm kim kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih sum la mowr uowi khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow Obed-Edawm hai aia kimchakuüa maten kowi peah prasi khai.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Akung kowi maru uang tek pe mang David mih, “Obed-Edawm kim kowi Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uowi rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow Obed-Edawm kowh kimchakuüa maten hai aia kowh uowi mih srui kowi peah prasi khai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi David dow nakowi kowkowiah hanow apiaw apama hown Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Obed-Edawm kim hownia Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Naiawng Jerusalem marow kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uang pawla mih khin khe akawt miuüa rik san taruk khawk now David dow chang phuchua khai. Nami phuchua dow chiala apum hai akauma mih chia chah apum hown aia changah khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />David dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh kawngah mih ephawd kowrmow khupla now aia kowh kür maten hown CHAKRAMANG pur kowi plai khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Naiawng hown David hai Israeluüa maten dow howla sawmlawm se hai tumla nang se apiaw apama hown CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowi Mikal khareah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Jerusalem marow kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uang tingla mih khin khe Sawl kowh chama Mikal dow tawngpawk hownia hawt mü khai. Now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi tapowr se mang David plai mih dow Mikal khita khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow sakdawng hownia David kowi suiah khai.<verse eid="2SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Maru kawmuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih uang pawla büah khai. Now nami vüi kowi kowh David khupah mih tangbung lak kowi uang towah büah khai. Now David dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap chang khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Nami uanap ki chang kung kowi dow David mih lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG ming hown maru kawmuüa kowi peah prasi khai. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Nami kung kowi aia dow kachakuüa hai masiuüa uowi mih maten kowi kawm apah chi, chaknga asek chi hai grep uih keu kawm apah chi peah khai. Nami kung kowi dow amatni bowkbowk mih chowlowkkow kim prakowi mang büah khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih aia kimchakuüa kowi napeah prasi kownkow kim prakowi haimang khai. Nami khin khe ahua hown nauang takrum kownkow Mikal mih prang kowi uang lawt khai. Now mapaw sak-ih dowi hown aia tek pe David mih, “Ani tarapdow Israel kowh mang mih lainowmma ka ringkawra khai pami kowmatia kowi tatuak khai! Aia dow tawnguat taklüp prang tuk rukrai dowi mih maru iawng aia kowh narmauüa pur kowi uowi khai!” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Now David tek pe Mikal mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh maru Israeluüa kowi nakruitown kownkow en pa kowi hai enni kimchak mia iawng mih kowi paw kloah dowi kowi ang kowi chowtaih klo ang khai. CHAKRAMANG pur kowi ang plai mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai. Aia pur kowi chowtaih ang napiaw kown. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Kowmatia kowi dow nami lak-e paw rukraira lang uowi mih iawng ang nauowi kown, now nami lak-e sowm iawng ang nauowi kown. Nachenganchepaw ang kowh narmauüa dow naringkaw ang kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Sawl kowh chama Mikal dow kowng pat hing kala chah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Mang David kowi Thurai kham pe lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Nami kung kowi dow mang David mih aia kim kowi kowuowi khai bowt. Now aria aret kowi kowh aia kowh ransu-uüa maten rut hownia CHAKRAMANG mih pe tanaiah khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />Akat khe risi Nathan kowi mang David tek pe mih, “Sam mü madiah, ang uowi mih dow sidar singh kim klangiungma mih kowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uowi mih dow tangbung kowi chowtaih!” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Nakhowk khe David kowi Nathan klangah mih, “En sak kowi uowi iawng chang diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow tawi uowila en reng chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Nachenganchepaw nami iak khe CHAKRAMANG uang tek pe Nathan mih, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Ang kowh nar David tut-e kowkowiah hanow en natek pe kown mih, ‘Ang nauowila kown mih kim en nathawp ang kown pabow en ka tuak? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi ang uang lawtla mih ni hownia ani mowr kowi tawng iawng mih kim kowi paw ang uowi dowi tak chekhai. Akeng kowi ang cham süt mih khin khe paw ang uowi mih dow tangbung kowi hai taklowp taklangra te kowi chowtaih. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Ang kowh maru Israeluüa cham kowi rah towng kowi amatni hown ang tawi uowi reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi naming nakhetah kownkow ang peah kurdik mih tara chet miuüa kowi dow, “Tawngplawng kowchow sidar singh hown ang uowi rah kim enni thawp ang dowi?” pami katpaw ang tek pe dowi chekhai,’ pape diah.<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Naiawng rakowi lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG kowh mami laiklow ang kowh nar David kowi kawmat kowtek pe diah, ‘En kowi dow dowm kowi kowh ruapur thing rah hownia ang uang pawla en khai, now ang kowh maru Israeluüa luk kowi kruitown miia ang thawp en khai. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />En cham kowiah mih rah maten kowi ang tawi uowila en reng chekhai. Now en kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi en pur hownia ang piakta en khai. En kowi dow lusa kowi kowh ming nang iukma mih maru iawng kri kraingma ang nachang en kown. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10-11" />Ang kowh maru Israeluüa vüi ang tow pe tara chet mih khowk chowdiah. Tawkche nami khin hownia now maru ngakuüa mih amatni kowi changah anowng apowng khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow amatni luk kowi naiawng naphaw kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh maru Israeluüa vüi ang lang khowmta pe uowi rah parah khowk chekhai. Nakowi dow athaulangma amatni naia uowi bowt kown, now amatni kowi miapaw naia changah anowng apowng kown nadowi bowt. Now amatni kowh ransu-uüa maten hownia amatni kowi ang pe tanaiah bowt kown. En kowh krungchakuüa kowi ang nape chowmah mang reng kown. <verse eid="2SA 7:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />En kowng kowh en kowh pipu-uüa tadupra kowi dup en mih khin khe en kowh chapa lowk ia kowi ang nape chowmah mang kown. Aia kowh pren dow anikma ang natow pe kown. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Aia dow ang vüi kowi nathawp ang kim lowk kown. Now aia kowh mang chowm rah dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma ang nachang pe kown. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Ang dow aia kowh pa nachowng kown, now aia dow ang kowh chapa nachowng kown. Aia che changta angak khai hanow achapa kowi a-pa ripah reng iawng aia kowi ang naripah kown. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Sawl luk kowi dow ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ang pawta pe khai. Naiawng hai aia kowh mang chowm rah mih ang pe en khai. Nachenganchepaw Sawl kowi ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ang pawta pe iawng en chapa kowi dow ang napawta pe kown nadowi. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />En kowh krungchakuüa hai pren dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi kown. En kowh mang chowm rah dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Now mukmang kowi kowh naiawngün laiklow maten dow David kowi Nathan tek pe khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chup Thurai se David tek awmrawm lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Naiawngün laiklow tata now mang David mih takrumra te lak kowi kowkup khai. Now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi chowm se tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang hai ang kimchakuüa dow tawngpaw asung uowi dowi mih maru chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw ang vüi kowi ahuma en chang ang khai. <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, anging vüi kowi naiawng khowt en chang anging khowk chepaw en nachang anging küng kown mih en nau reng tak. En dow pur prakowi kowh ang kowh krungchakuüa vüi paw en khamla lai khai. Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, maru maten kowi naiawng bow en chang pe reng?<verse eid="2SA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en kowh nar David kowh saktuak dow en aiawng tuk towbowt. Naiawng rakowi ang natek en kown mih tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Naiawngün kri kraingma mih lup en chang mih dow en kowh laikham rakowi hai en sak nau rakowi chekhai. En dow kri kraingma mih lup nowng chang pami en pe tuk ang kownkow kri kraingma mih lup en chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en dow akri akraingma! En iawng mih miapaw uowi dowi bowt, now en klen kowi akeng mih Thurai lang uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawngün laiklow dow anging ta khowk. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Nami klen kowi en kowh maru Israel chenchap iawng mih dow lusa kowi mia iawng mih chenchap paw lang uowi dowi bowt. Amatni kowi dow en kowh maru en nachangla kownkow Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup changra hownia en uang lawngla khai. Naiawng en uang lawngla mih khin khe amatni naring nakaw en kownkow amatni pur kowi dow akri kraingma mih lup hai kramra uowima mih lup en chang pe khai. En kowh maru Israeluüa vüi kowi amatni pur hownia akeng mih chenchapuüa hai thuraiuüa kowi en prütta pe khai. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Israeluüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi en kowh maru en changla khai. Now aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow amatni kowh Thurai en chowng khai.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Kawmat mih aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en kowh nar ang hai ang kowh krungchakuüa lawnguan kowi kowh en kowh laikham dow chowngchowng saksakma townah reng diah. Nami en kowh laikham iawng changah reng diah. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Nahanow en kowh ming dow chowngchowng saksakma akri akraingma naown kown towbowt. Now maru-uüa mih, ‘Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Israel kowh Thurai,’ padow natek büah kown. Now en kowh nar David krungchakuüa kowi mih anikma en nape uowiah kown towbowt.<verse eid="2SA 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />“Aw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Israel kowh Thurai. Ang kowh krungchakuüa kowi en nape chowmah mang kown mih lawnguan en phuang ang khai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh nar sakkraingma hown naiawng uam lü uam leng en mih chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />Aw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG, en dow Thurai chekhai. En kowh laikham dow anowmma chekhai, now mami aiungma mih laikham dow en kowh nar tut-e en khamah khai. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Naiawng rakowi chowngchowng saksakma naia uowila kownkow kawmat mih en nar kowh krungchakuüa kowi sakrauma hown peah prasi diah. Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, nami laiklow dow en tekta khowk chekhai, now en kowh prasi dow ang kowh krungchakuüa luk kowi chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">David awng tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Akung kowi dow David mih Filistinuüa kowi senah hanow nowngta khai. Now Filistinuüa kowh Methek-Ama marow mih aia powngta pe khai.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />David dow Moabuüa kowi paw nowngta khai. Now aia dow amatni kowi mih krawng kowi atanma pe mawkah khai. Now rik khüa mih pre ia chi mih kowi dow aia saita hanow sum lawmbawr kowi kowh dow aia pe plaiah lowk ia chi khai; naiawng hai aia dow sum bak kowi pabak mih Moabuüa kowi saita khai. Now naiawngün ta sing mih Moabuüa dow David kowh nar chowng hanow aia kowi peah mangmu büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Nami klen kowi David dow mang Hadadezer kowi senah hanow nowngta khai. Naiawng David senah mih dow mang Hadadezer Iufratis aw re-e kowh aia kowh krawng bawn nakrawi plan powng iawk kownkow uang tarü mih khin khe chekhai. Mang Hadadezer dow Siria pren kowi kowh Zoba marow mang chekhai, now a-pa dow Rehawb chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />David dow mang Hadadezer kowh kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih 1,700 ia siphaiuüa hai khawk hown kowh mang mih 20,000 ia siphaiuüa kowi hawt khümta khai. Aia dow amatni kowh kawrnga kari pungmadawng hownia 100 klüng towah khai. Now akeng mih kawrnga maten kowi dow tüngta pe uowntüng sa bowk khai.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Nami khin khe Damaska marow kowi kowh Siriauüa dow mang Hadadezer kowi uang tawi khowngah tasen kownkow uang büah khai. Nakhowk khe David dow amatni kowh maru iun 22,000 ia kowi hawt saita pe khai. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Now Siria pren kowi kowh Damaska marow kowi David mih tow pe siphai hawmh khai. Nahanow Siriauüa dow David kowh nar chowng hanow aia kowi peah mangmu büah khai. CHAKRAMANG dow David cham kowi rah towng kowi pe awngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />David mih mang Hadadezer kowh maru iukuüa kowh kuh kawngma ün Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Now Hadadezer kowh Beta marow hai Berothai marow hownia paw mang David mih kri ahuma uang pawla khai.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9-10" />Hamat marow mang Tawi hai mang Hadadezer iüah dow ransu chekhai. Amatchi dow khin khin tadowk tasen reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Hadadezer kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi David saita mih satang tata hanow mang Tawi dow awmrawm khai. Naiawng rakowi David kowi nauang kiowriah kownkow mang Tawi dow achapa Joram kowi David tut-e uang chinah khai. Now Joram dow David vüi kuh uanh, tai uanh hai kri uanh ün uang pawla pe khai. <verse eid="2SA 8:9-10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11-12" />Naiawngün Joram uang pawla pe mih uanh maten dow David mih CHAKRAMANG vüi lang kraah khai. Naiawngün uanh paw Siriauüa, Moabuüa, Filistinuüa, Amalekuüa hai Zoba marow mang Hadadezer büah hownia kowh kaah mih kuh hai tai uanh maten hown CHAKRAMANG vüi aia lang kraah khai.<verse eid="2SA 8:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />David dow Awisa lawngrawi kowi Siriauüa kowi saita 18,000 ia chekhai. Nami hownia uang plan kung kowi David kowh ming iung nang iung dow ariaret kowi cham krawi tauet khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Edawm pren paprenma kowi David mih krawi tow pe Israel siphaiuüa tangbung khupra khai. Nahanow Edawmuüa maten dow David kowh nar chowng khai bowt. CHAKRAMANG dow David cham kowi rah towng kowi pe awngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowh maru iukuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />David dow Israeluüa pren paprenma luk kowi chowm mang khai. Aia dow aia kowh maru-uüa luk kowi tara nowm chet pe reng, now aiungma kruitownah reng chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Zerui kowh chapa Joab dow siphai lang kri mih chekhai. Now Ahilud kowh chapa Jehosafat dow mang kowh chownglawng lawnguan rui mih chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Ahitub kowh chapa Zadawk hai Abiathar kowh chapa Ahimelek iüah dow uamow chekhai. Now Seraia dow cha rui mih chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Mang chawng mih kowi kowh lang kri mih dow Jehoiada chapa Benaia chekhai. Now David kowh chapauüa dow uamowuüa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Uamowuüa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami kowi tawngbak mih Baibul kowi dow prengia pek mih pahai arui uowi ne chekhai.</char></note> chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Mefiboset kowi David saksing sanaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Akat khe maru kawmuüa kowi David lüntaah mih, “Saul kimchakuüa ta sing mih uowi ne tak bow? Ta uowi ne tak hanow Jonathan kaah sakowm iawng aia kowi dow ang nasaksing nasanaah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Sawl kimchakuüa kowh dow Ziba pami nar uowi lowk ia chekhai. Aia kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih David tut-e uang pawla khai. Aia kowi mang David lüntaah mih, “En chowbowt bow Ziba?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Ziba klangah mih, “Ow, en kowh nar Ziba dow ang chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Mang lüntaah mih, “Saul kimchakuüa ta sing mih uowi ne tak bow? Ta uowi ne tak hanow aia kowi Thurai kowh saksing sanara ang natüng pe kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Ziba klangah mih, “Kawmat paw Jonathan kowh chapa sing uowi lowk ia tak. Tawkche aia kowh klowng pre pra trui abaima chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Mang lüntaah mih, “Aia dow tawng kowi chow uowi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Ziba klangah mih, “Aia dow Lo-Debar marow kowi kowh Amiel chapa Makir kim kowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Nahanow David mih Lo-Debar marow kowi kowchin maru khai. Now nami maru-uüa mih Amiel kowh chapa Makir kim hownia aia kowi uang pawla khai.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Aia dow Mefiboset chekhai. Aia kowh pa dow Jonathan chekhai, now Jonathan kowh pa dow Sawl chekhai. Mefiboset dow David re-e uang towm hanow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se David kowi chupah khai. David tek pe mih, “Mefiboset chowbowt bow en?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Mefiboset klangah mih, “Ow, en kowh nar chowbowt ang,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />David tek pe mih, “Hangkow kram. En pa Jonathan tut-e ang takhamta iawng ang nasaksing nasana en kown taih. En pu Sawl kowh krawng bawn maten ang naplan peta en iawk kown. Now en dow ang hown atungma ang kowh pawitang kowi natawi taiua cha hawm cha kan kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Now Mefiboset dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se David kowi plan chupah khai. Now aia tek pe David mih, “Mami en kowh nar ang dow kui uak iawng asung uowi dowi mih maru chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw tawngplawng kowchow makhowt pat en tuk saksing sana ang khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Nakhowk khe Sawl kowh nar Ziba kowi hawah now David tek pe mih, “En kowh kim iah Sawl hai aia kimchakuüa kowh uowi mih maten achu Mefiboset kowi ang peta khowk. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />En, en chapauüa hai en kowh naruüa dow Mefiboset kimchakuüa vüi nachang pe lup kown. Nahanow amatni dow naka chakkham kown towbowt. Nachenganchepaw en kowh kim iah kowh chu Mefiboset dow ang kowh pawitang kowi atungma natawi cha hawm cha kan reng kown,” pakhai. (Ziba kowh dow chapa uowi 15 ia, now anaruüa uowi 20 ia chekhai).<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11-13" />Nakhowk khe Ziba tek pe mang mih, “Aw mangkri, en kowh nar ang kowi kowh en tek ang mih srui ang nachang kown taih,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Ziba kimchak hai aia kowh naruüa maten dow Mefiboset kimchakuüa vüi chang pe lup khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Ziba kimchakuüa hai aia kowh naruüa maten dow Mefiboset kowh naruüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:11-13">Mefiboset kowh dow klowng pre pra trui abaima chekhai. Nami hownia now Mefiboset dow Jerusalem marow kowi tawi uowi khai bowt, now aia dow mang kowh chapa iawng hai mang kowh pawitang kowi tawi taiua cha hawm cha kan khai bowt. Aia kowh dow Mika pami chapa uowi lowk ia. Achapa dow ngeuüa reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 9:11-13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Amawnuüa hai Siriauüa kowi David senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Nami kung kowi Amawnuüa kowh mang Nahas dow kowng khai bowt. Now achapa Hanun dow aia takcha kowi ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />David tek mih, “Hanun kowh pa Nahas ang luk kowi kaah sakowmma uowi iawng achapa Hanun luk kowi paw kaah sakowmma ang nauowi pe kown,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Hanun kowh pa kowng mih lawnguan kowi nakowtawi tek pe sakklamra laiklow kownkow David mih aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi kowchin pe pre sum ia khai. Nahanow David kowh maru iukuüa dow Amawnuüa pren kowi kowkowi khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />Nachenganchepaw nakhowk khe mang Hanun kowi Amawnuüa kowh aluchowuüa uang tek pe mih, “En pa kowi ringkawah rakowi nauang tek en sakklamra laiklow kownkow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi David uang chinah mih pabow en ka tuak? Naiawngünuüa kowi David uang chinah mih dow a-i kowh marow krawi kumüla hanow akung kowi uang ta sen a-i kownkow chowbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Naiawng rakowi Hanun dow David kowh maru-uüa kowi hawt khümah khai. Now amatni kowi dow papra chowchi khaita pe mawmpawi khai, now kowrmow athawngma mih paw kelang mowr chi kepta pe bowk khai. Mang Hanun dow naiawng amatni kowi peah rukrai hanow chinta khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow kim kowi kowmang kown mih lainowmma rukrai khai bowt. Naiawngün lawnguan dow David kowi maru kowtek pe khai. Now David dow naiawngün maru hown nauang takrum kownkow kowchin pe maru pre sum ia khai. Nakhowk khe David krawi tek pe mih, “Enni kowh mawmpawi adawngma awr awm dowi mowr Jeriko marow kowi uowi büah diah towbowt. Nami kung kowi phai uang mang büah iang,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Now Amawnuüa dow amatni kowi lainowmma David kunmarauah mih tuk khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Amawnuüa dow amatni tatawn taret mih pren hownia cham nga siphaiuüa khai. Naiawngün siphaiuüa dow Bet-Rehawb hai Zoba pami arah hownia khawk hown kowh mang mih Siriauüa 20,000 ia, Maka pren mang hai aia kowh siphaiuüa 1,000 ia, now Tawb pren hownia kowh siphaiuüa 12,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Nami satang tata hanow David dow Amawnuüa kowi nakowsenah kownkow Joab hai aia kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi kowchinah khai. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Amawnuüa kowh siphai hawmh dow natasen kownkow uang lawt hanow marow tapplawt kowi uang uowi büah khai. Now Zoba hai Rehawb pami arah hownia kowh Aram siphaiuüa, Tawb hai Maka pren hownia kowh siphaiuüa mih natasen kownkow dowm kowi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Now Joab dow aia pur prakowi hai kung prakowi Siria siphaiuüa uowi mih khita khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia siphaiuüa kowi ruiah sangrum hanow Siria siphaiuüa kowi nasenah kownkow towah khai. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Now akeng mih siphaiuüa kowi dow ataimow Abisai rut kowi ap pe khai. Now amatni kowi dow Amawnuüa kowi nasenah kownkow towah khai. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Joab tek pe ataimow mih, “Siriauüa che ang lak-e lang kür khai hanow en nauang khowng ang kown takla. Now Amawnuüa che en lak-e lang kür khai hanow ang nauang khowng en kown taih. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Sakkraingma hown a-i uowi diah sik! Now a-i kowh maru-uüa vüi hai a-i kowh Thurai kowh marow maten vüi sakkraingma hown a-i dowk tasen diah sik. CHAKRAMANG mih aia tut-e iung iawng naia changla kownkow ang nachup a-i Thurai kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Now Joab dow aia kowh siphaiuüa hown Siriauüa kowi nakowsenah kownkow tarü khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Siriauüa dow amatni pur hownia powt khai. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Naiawng Siriauüa powt mih khita hanow Amawnuüa paw Abisai pur hownia powt khai, now amatni dow marow kowi kowkup khai. Naiawng rakowi Joab dow Amawnuüa hown tasenla dowi kowi Jerusalem marow kowi plan khai.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Siriauüa dow Israeluüa kowi nowng dowi bowt mih tuk hanow arasang takua talawm büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Now mang Hadadezer dow Iufratis aw paipra pown kowi kowh uowi mih Siriauüa kowi nauang hawla kownkow kowchin maru khai. Nahanow Siriauüa dow Helam marow kowi uang büah khai. Now uang hawla mih maru-uüa luk kowi chang aluchow mih dow Hadadezer kowh siphai aluchow Sobak chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Nami satang tata kung kowi David mih Israel siphaiuüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah hanow haipown Jawrdan aw khai, now Helam marow kowi kowkowi büah khai. Now Siriauüa dow David hai aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi nakowsenah kownkow siphaiuüa kowi towah khai, now amatni dow kowbüah kowi senah khai. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Nachenganchepaw Siriauüa dow Israeluüa pur hownia plan powt khai iawk. Nakhowk khe David mih amatni kowh kawrnga kari te mih maru 700 ia kowi hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih 40,000 ia kowi saita khai. Now amatni kowh siphai aluchow Sobak kowi paw nakowi aia saita khai. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Now amatni dow Israeluüa tut-e sum mih chowbowt pami Hadadezer nimkrüa kowi kowh uowi mih manguüa tuk khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Israeluüa hown taking tasangra laikham tatow büah khai bowt. Nahanow amatni dow Israeluüa kowh nar chowng khai bowt. Nami hownia bowt now Siriauüa dow Amawnuüa kowi natawi khowngah kown mih kram khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">David hai Betseba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Chungrau khin chur prakowi dow manguüa mih cham tasen reng chekhai. Paning khe dow mang David mih cham tasen kownkow Joab hai aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa hailawm Israel siphaiuüa maten kowi cham chinah khai. Amatni dow Amawnuüa kowi kowsenah khai, now Amawnuüa kowh Rabba marow kri mih umta pe lut büah khai. Nachenganchepaw David dow Jerusalem marow kowi ta uowi khai.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Now akat khe sat kowi prakowi David mih aia mawk rah hownia awr rü hanow aia kowh kimluk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kimluk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow pakka kimluk iawng anaima chekhai.</char></note> kowi kowlen khai. Nami khin khe aia dow kimluk hownia masiuüa lu tui mih khi lowk ia khai. Nami masiuüa dow klangiungma chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Nami masiuüa lawnguan kowi nakrawi paw satang kownkow David mih kowchin maru lowk ia khai. Now nami maru uang tek pe mih, “Paimi masiuüa ming dow Betseba chekhai. A-pa dow Eliam, now ahua dow Hit chenchap Uria chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Now nami masiuüa kowi nauang pawla kownkow David mih kowchin maru khai. Now nami masiuüa uang hanow aia kowi dow David hawt phua iuaah khai. (Nami khin khe aia dow <char style="w">uisawng</char> uowi khe kowh asürlawkma mih hownia tachim tasai krowngchow taih tak chekhai). Nami kung kowi aia dow kim kowi mang khai bowt, <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />now akung kowi dow aia kum nau mih aia tatuk khai bowt. Nahanow nami satang dow David kowi aia uang krawi phowng pe khai.<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Nakhowk khe David mih Hit chenchap Uria kowi aia tut-e nauang hawla kownkow Joab tut-e kowchin maru khai. Naiawng rakowi Joab dow Uria kowi David tut-e uang chin pe khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Uria uang ting hanow David mih Joab hai aia kowh siphaiuüa satang hown tasen lawnguan aia kowi hawt lüntaah khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Nami kung kowi David tek pe Uria mih, “Kim kowi kowmang diah, now sau bawng sau pang hanow tanai diah,” pakhai. Nahanow Uria dow mang kim hownia lawt khai bowt, now aia kowi dow David krawi sa pe awmrawm sung khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Nachenganchepaw Uria dow aia kim kowi kowmang dowi chekhai. Aia dow mang kowh kangchawng miuüa hown mang kimplawt re-e tawi müi khai.<verse eid="2SA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Nami laiklow dow David kowi maru kowtek pe khai. Now David tek pe Uria mih, “Tasenra kowi en cham uowi mih akrama khowk nadowi bow? Nachenganchepaw tawngplawng kowchow kim kowi en kowmang dowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Uria tek pe David mih, “Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hown Israel kowh siphai hawmh hai Juda kowh siphai hawmh cham uowi mih dow tangbung kowi chowtaih. Now ang kowh siphai aluchow Joab hai aia kowh maru-uüa cham khup tangbung mih paw dowm kowi chowtaih. Nami kowi tawng iawng chow kim kowi ang nakowmangah kown? Now kowcha kowkham now masi hown tawng iawng chow ang kowtaiua müiah kown? Ang uam kham sawi, naiawng mih lup dow katpaw ang nachang kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Nakhowk khe David tek pe mih, “Ani paw makowi uowi diah towbowt. Tharau khe tasenra kowi ang pe mang en kown towbowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Uria dow nami ni hai auai ni paw Jerusalem marow kowi uowila khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Now David mih aia hown natawi taiua cha iak hawm kownkow Uria kowi hawah khai. Now Uria kowi dow pua pat aia pe khamah arak khai. Tawkchedow nami iak paw Uria mih kim kowi kowmang dowi chekhai. Aia dow David kowh kangchawng miuüa tut-e tawi plan müi khai iawk.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Auai rau dow David mih Joab vüi rui chasak lowk hanow Uria kung krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Nami chasak kowi David krawi rui pe mih, “Tasenra kowi kowh kramra lang uowi mih arah kowi Uria kowi pe rik khüaah diah, now aia kowi dow akung hownia enni napowtta pe kown. Nahanow aia dow ka arau now nakowng kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Naiawng rakowi kowrum marow mih khin khe Joab dow lang kür mih ransu-uüa hown natasen kownkow Uria kowi chinah khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Akung kowi marowchakuüa dow uang lawt hanow Joab hai aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi uang senah khai. Nakhowk khe David kowh siphaiuüa mih kowng sangrum khai. Now Hit chenchap Uria paw tawi kowng khai.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Nami kung kowi dow Joab mih tasenra kowi kowh satang maten David kowi nauang phowng pe kownkow kowchin maru khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Nami maru kowi Joab krawi tek pe mih, “Tasenra kowi kowh maiawngün satang maten David kowi kowphuang pe diah. <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />Naiawngün satang en tek pe kung kowi aia dow nakunmarau chepaw naia kown. Now maiawng aia natek en chepaw naia kown, ‘Tasen kownkow tawngplawng kowchow marow hown atawnchow enni kowtuk kowi khai? Tap luk hownia salangba hown naap enni kown mih enni tuk dowi bow? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Thebez pami arah kowi Gideawn kowh chapa Abimelek tawng iawng chow kowng mih enni ka tuak dowi bow? Abimelek kowi dow kawm küa müa hua hown tap luk hownia masiuüa lowk ia mih iu kuakah khai. Nahanow Abimelek dow nakowi hing kowng khai. Naiawng chepaw tawngplawng kowchow tap hown atawnchow enni kowtuk kowi khai?’ napa kown. Naiawng che aia tek en khai hanow Hit chenchap Uria kowng tüng khowk padow en natek pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Nami maru dow David tut-e kowtowm hanow Joab krawi pe tekah mih laiklow maten David kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Aia tek pe David mih, “Ransu-uüa dow nauang sen anging kownkow marow hownia uang lawt hanow dowm kowi uang büah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow marow tapplawt mowr anging kawikrawiah khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Nami khin khe ransu-uüa dow tap luk hownia salangba hown iu ap anging khai. Nahanow en kowh siphaiuüa dow kowng sangrum khai. Now Hit chenchap en kowh nar Uria paw tawi kowng khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />David tek pe mih, “Joab kowi en kowtek pe kown mih, ‘En mih hangkow sak nga diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tasenra kowi dow lowra maru kowng reng chekhai. Marow mih asaima piak pat phai senah ngamlam diah,’ pape diah. Now Joab kowi peah süngürra diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Now Uria kowh masi dow ahua kowng mih satang tata hanow uowila uiting uangtak khai. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Uowila uiting uangtak mih khin chur kung kowi dow David mih aia kim kowi Betseba kowi uang pawla khai. Now aia dow Betseba kowi chawngah khai, now amatchi dow ka chapa lowk ia khai. Tawkche naiawng David chang mih CHAKRAMANG dow sak-ih dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">David kowi risi Nathan uang tüng pe atawi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow risi Nathan kowi David tut-e uang chin pe khai. Now risi Nathan dow maiawng David kowi lawp pe sangchia lowk khai, “Lowk mih marow kowi maru uowi pre ia. Lowk ia mih dow kurengma, now alowk mih dow ngaraima chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Kurengma mih maru kowh dow chia tawn hai ruapur tawn uowi ahuma chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Nachenganchepaw angaraima mih maru kowh dow cham ranah mih ruapur iia apumchow klen kowi tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. Aia dow nami ruapur iia kowi thumah khai, now nami ruapur iia dow aia kowh chauüa hown awr tawi iuksown khai. Aia dow aia chaah mih chakkham hownia nami ruapur iia kowi pela khai, tui paw aia khamah mih bia hownia pe khamah khai, now müi khe paw aia dow dawila reng chekhai. Naiawng hai aia dow nami ruapur iia kowi aia kowh chama iawng changla khai. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Akat khe nami kurengma mih maru kim kowi pinsüa uang pün lowk ia khai. Nachenganchepaw nami maru dow aia kowh pinsüa vüi nachang pe kan kownkow aia kowh chia hai ruapur mih uam ngen dowi chekhai. Aia dow angaraima mih maru kowh ruapur iia apumchow mih kowpawta pe khai, now aia kowh pinsüa vüi changla pe kan khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Nami laiklow tata hanow David mih nami kurengma mih maru luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Aia tek pe Nathan mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang tek khowk; naiawng chang mih maru kowi dow nakowngta kown takla. <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Aia dow ngaraima mih kowi saksing sanaah dowi kowi apumchow mih ruapur iia pawta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi apumchow mih takcha tali pum aia naiaw kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Nakhowk khe Nathan tek pe David mih, “Nami maru dow en chowbowt! CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih maiawng: Israeluüa luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow <char style="w">nümnap</char> en mih dow ang chowtaih, now Sawl rut hownia lawng en mih paw ang chowtaih. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />En kowh kim iah kim dow ang pe en khai, now aia kowh masi hawmuüa paw ang pe en khai. En kowi dow Israel hai Juda krungchak luk kowi ang pe chowm en mang khai. Naiawngün en talawk dowi tak chepaw ang naplan pe en küng kown taih diah. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Nachenganchepaw tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow en nü en klowk dowi? Tawngplawng kowchow aia mik kowi angakma mih lup en tuk chang khai? Hit chenchap Uria kowi dow Amawnuüa kowi en pe saiah khai, now amasi kowi dow en changla en kowh masi khai. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Naiawng rakowi en kimchakuüa mih tasen hown nakowng reng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow nü ang klowk ang dowi chekhai. Hit chenchap Uria kowh masi kowi en changla en kowh masi khai.<verse eid="2SA 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />“En kimchak hownia dow ang nauang pawla en phih kown. En kowh masi hawmh kowi dow akeng mih maru lowk ia rut kowi en pur kowi ang napeah kown. Now en kowh masi hawmuüa kowi dow aia mih maru pur kowi naphua naiuaah kown. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Nami lup ngak en chang mih dow kukpa chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw mami lup dow Israeluüa maten pur kowi ang nachangah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Nakhowk khe David tek pe Nathan mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak ang changta khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Nathan klangah mih, “En kowh ngak dow CHAKRAMANG lawtta en khowk; en kowng dowi tham. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Nachenganchepaw nami lup en chang mih dow CHAKRAMANG kowi en khareah mih iawng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh chapa mih nakowng ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowh chapa kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Nathan mih kim prakowi mang khai bowt. Now CHAKRAMANG dow Uria masi hown kowh David kaah mih chapa kowi arau dikma pe phawah khai. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Nami khin khe David dow achapa iung müa vüi CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü khai. Aia dow tawngpaw cha dowi kham dowi chekhai, now aia towklak kowi kowkup hanow uar prowt chi kimphai kowi aia mawk kunlun khai. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Now aia kowh maru iukuüa dow aia kowi kowkrüngah kownkow aia re-e kowkowi khai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow rü pe dowi chekhai, now amatni hown tawi taiua cha hawm kan kown mih paw nau pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Arau uowi mih ranit ni kung kowi nami ngeuüa dow kowng khai bowt. Achapa kowng mih satang aia kowh maru-uüa mih David kowi kowuam tek pe dowi chekhai. Amatni tatek mih, “Achapa sing uowi reng tak khe khowm padow aia nau sünta a-i laiklow dowi chekhai. Nami kowi achapa kowng mih satang tawng iawng chow kawmat aia kowi a-i kowphowng pe kown? A-i che kowtek pe now aia mih natachang naklak ün tarawng,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh maru iukuüa naiawng tatek laisin mih khita hanow David mih achapa kowng khowk pami tuk khai bowt. Now amatni kowi aia lüntaah mih, “Ang kowh chapa kowng khai bowt bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Kowbüah klangah mih, “Ow, kowng khai bowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Nakhowk khe dow David mih kimphai hownia awr rü now cham lu khai, now phawk unsi paingbawng ün hanow leta tawnguat khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkowi hanow kowkiow Thurai khai. Nami kung kowi dow aiamat kim kowi uang plan mang hanow aia kowi nauang then pe hawm kan kownkow aia mih lawt ana khai. Aia pur kowi uang then pe hawm kan hanow aia dow cha khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Aia kowh maru iukuüa lüntaah mih, “Naiawng en chang mih auan tawng chow? En chapa sing uowi reng tak khe dow tawngpaw cha dowi kham dowi kowi aia vüi en kar khai. Tawkche aia kowng kung kowi dow en awr rü hanow en cha en kham khai!” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />David tek pe mih, “Ow, aia sing uowi reng tak khe dow tawngpaw cha dowi kham dowi kowi aia vüi ang kar khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG saksing sana ang hanow ang kowh chapa nasing kown taih padow ang ka tuak chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow aia kowng khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia vüi cha dowi kham dowi kowi tawngplawng kowchow ang nauowi bowt kown? Aia kowi ang plan ia sing iawk kown bow? Pani dow aia tut-e ang nakowkowi kown. Tawkche aia dow ang tut-e nauang plan kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn uang dia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24-25" />David dow amasi Betseba kowi depah ruaah khai, now aia dow amasi hown kowplan taphua taiua khai bowt. Now amasi dow kum nau hanow ka chapa lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Sawlawmawn pahai David rük pe khai. Now risi Nathan mih David tut-e uangah hanow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Jedidiah pahai nami ngiachow kowi uang rük pe ming khai. (Jedidiah pami dow “CHAKRAMANG sakrauah mih” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ngiachow kowi dow CHAKRAMANG sakrauah khai.<verse eid="2SA 12:24-25" /></para>
  <para style="s">David powngta pe Rabba marow kri mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Joab dow Amawnuüa kowh Rabba marow kri kowi kowsenah khai, now nami marow dow aia powngta pe khai. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Now Joab dow David tut-e kowchin maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “Rabba marow dow ang senta khowk, now amatni kala tui mih arah dow ang powngta pe khowk chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Akeng mih siphaiuüa kowi kawmat en kuaah lawmah diah. Now marow mih uang rumah hanow uang powngta diah. Nadowi now marow mih ang nakrawi powngta kown. Nahanow marow ming dow ang kowh ming nachowng kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Naiawng rakowi David mih siphaiuüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah now Rabba marow kowi kowkowi khai. Now amatni dow marow mih kowsenah hanow powngta büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Aia dow nami marow kowi kowh mang lu hownia mang lukruk mih pawta pe khai, now aia lu kowi krukah khai. Nami lukruk dow kuh 34 set ngia hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai, now asung khakma mih hua ün paw dan pe khai. Aia dow nami marow hownia asung khakma mih uanh ahuma pawla khai. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Aia dow marowchakuüa kowi uang lawtla hanow kür hown sawksak, lawngha tim hai marek hown pe changah lup khai. Now amatni kowi dow <char style="w">ipbawn</char> paw pe thawpah khai. Amawnuüa kowh akeng mih marow maten kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi paw naiawng David pe changah khai. Nami kung kowi dow David mih aia kowh siphai hawmh maten kowi pawla now Jerusalem marow kowi kowplan mang khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amnawn hai atuamow Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Akung kowi dow maiawng uang phaw khai. David kowh chapa Absalawm kowh dow Tamar pami tuamow klangiungma mih uowi lowk ia chekhai. Now akeng mih masi hown kowh David kaah mih chapa Amnawn dow Tamar kowi naukhi-ah khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Tamar dow kachakuüa hown katpaw taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Amnawn mih Tamar kowi kaah dowi tham padow ka tuak khai. Aia dow naiawng Tamar vüi tuak lai rakowi kow nga prang towbowt chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Amnawn kowh dow apahi Simea kowh chapa Jonadab pami auiua uowi lowk ia. Aia dow nowm nowm puanla khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Akat khe Jonadab tek pe Amnawn mih, “Aw mangkri chapa, pani kowh pani en kowh kow uang nga ngamlam kowbow! Tawng chow en own?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Amnawn tek pe Jonadab mih, “Ang kowh tainau Absalawm kowh tuamow Tamar kowi ang naukhi kowh chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Jonadab tek pe mih, “Phangbek kowi kowmawk now kowchang krau iow diah. En pa uang mü en khe maiawng en hawt tek pe kown, ‘Nauang thawp ang chakkham kownkow sakrauma hown ang tuamow Tamar kowi uang chin ang diah. Aia mih ang pur kowi pauang thawp ang kawmpah lah, now aia pacham sawk ang lah,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Naiawng rakowi Amnawn dow phangbek kowi kowmawk hanow chang arau uowi mih iow khai. Now aia kowi mang uang müah khe aia hawt tek pe mih, “Nauang thawp ang chakkham kownkow sakrauma hown ang tuamow Tamar kowi uang chin ang diah. Aia mih ang pur kowi pauang thawp ang kawmpah lah, now aia pacham sawk ang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Nahanow David mih Tamar tut-e kowchin maru khai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, “En rakmow Amnawn tut-e kowkowi diah, now aia vüi kowthawp pe kawmpah dit,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Naiawng rakowi Tamar dow arak Amnawn kim kowi kowkowi khai. Nami khin khe Amnawn dow hawt mawk phülü khai. Now aia pur kowi Tamar mih lawk kawmdi khai, now paah hanow heuah khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Tamar dow nami kawmpah mih apherklapma mih angai müa hown kowpawla pe hanow aia pur kowi then pe khai. Nachenganchepaw Amnawn dow nami kawmpah cha kown nau dowi chekhai. Aia dow aia re-e kowh uowi miuüa kowi nalawt bowk kownkow tek pe khai. Nahanow maru-uüa maten dow lawt bowk khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Nakhowk khe Amnawn tek pe Tamar mih, “Chakkham mih ang kowh mawk rah towklak kowi uang pawla diah, now uang sawk ang diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Tamar mih aia thawpah kawmpah ün pawla now arakmow Amnawn kowh mawk rah towklak kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Now nasawk pe chakkham kownkow Amnawn re-e aia kowtatawn mih khin khe Amnawn mih aia kowi hawt dowkah chap khai. Now Amnawn tek pe mih, “Ang hown tawi taiua mawk diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tamar tek pe mih, “Hauang piak ang siri diah! Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi maiawng mih lup chang kown mih mapaw taka dowi chekhai! Maiawng mih suiiai kaniaima mih lup hang chang diah! <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Maiawng khowt mih rukraira hown tawng iawng chow maru pur kowi ang kowh lumowr ang natüngah kown? Now Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi en kowi paw angakma mih maru pahai natuk en kown chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami lawnguan sakrauma hown mang tut-e phai kowtek diah. Nahanow aia mih nape tachawng achi kown taih,” pape khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Nachenganchepaw Amnawn mih Tamar kowh laiklow sünta pe dowi chekhai. Aia dow Tamar lak-e lang kür chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow kür hown Tamar kowi phua iuaah khai.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Amnawn mih Tamar kowi nowm nowm suiah khai bowt. Aia dow Tamar kowi aia naukhi-ah mih lak-e lang suiah khai bowt. Tamar kowi aia tek pe mih, “Rü now powt bowt!” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Nachenganchepaw Tamar tek pe mih, “Naiawng hauang chang ang diah! Ang luk kowi dow en changta ang angak khowk chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en plan pe powt ang hanow ang luk kowi en changta angak khowk mih lak-e lang nga chekhai,” pape khai. Nachenganchepaw Amnawn mih Tamar kowh laiklow sünta pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Aia dow anar kowi hawah now tek pe mih, “Mami masiuüa kowi ang pur hownia prang kowi kowlawtta diah, now kliata pe kimbüng diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Naiawng rakowi nami nar dow Tamar kowi lawtta now kliata pe kimbüng khai. Nakhowk khe kowh Tamar khupah mih tawnguat dow athawngma chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kachakuüa hown katpaw taphua taiua dowi tak mih mangkri chamauüa dow naiawng mih chowtaih khup reng. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Nami hownia lawt hanow Tamar mih aia lu kowi prui plawi khai, now aia khupah mih tawnguat dow thekah khai. Now aia dow rut hown pumla lumowr hanow atün atünma karla se powt khai.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Aia kowi arakmow Absalawm lüntaah mih, “Tum, en rakmow Amnawn piak en siri bow? Nachenganchepaw mami lawnguan dow mia kowi paw hang cham tek ba. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow en rakmow chekhai. Mami lawnguan kowi hangkow tuak krat diah,” pakhai. Nami hownia bowt now Tamar dow tawmpa sak piakma hown arakmow Absalawm kim kowi tawi uowi khai.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Nami laiklow tata hanow mang David mih lainowmma kunmarau khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Nachenganchepaw Absalawm dow Amnawn kowi aiung angak tawngpaw tek pe dowi chekhai. Tawkche atuamow Tamar kowi piakta pe siri khai rakowi Absalawm mih Amnawn kowi lainowmma suiah khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amnawn kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Pre ning kung kowi Absalawm mih aia kowh ruapur hawmh kowi nakep pe pawi kownkow Baal-Hazawr pami arah kowi chang pawi khai. Nami arah dow Efraim marow hown atawnchow chekhai. Now nami pawi kowi nauang tawi kownkow aia dow mangkri chapauüa maten kowi krawi haw krawi laila khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Absalawm dow mang David tut-e kowkowiah now tek pe mih, “En nar ang kowh ruapur hawmh kowi nakep pe pawi kownkow ang chang pawi lowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown en hai en kowh maru iukuüa mih ang kowh pawi kowi uang tawi ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Mang tek pe mih, “Iung khowkchow le, pa! Anging tawi bowk dowi bowt tak. Anging che tawi bowk hanow en kowh pusa müa taih,” pape khai. Absalawm dow mang David natawi kownkow lainowmma kükla khai. Nachenganchepaw mang David dow tawi pe dowi chekhai. Tawkche aia mih Absalawm kowi krawi peah prasi khai.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Nakhowk khe Absalawm tek pe mang mih, “En che tawi dowi hanow ang tainau Amnawn kowi krawi chin ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Mang lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en hown Amnawn tawi takla khai?” pape khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Nachenganchepaw Absalawm dow mang kowi kükah rengreng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mang mih aia kowh akeng mih chapauüa maten hai Amnawn kowi krawi chin pe khai.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Akung kowi Absalawm tek pe aia kowh naruüa mih, “Sünta büa diah, grep tui hown Amnawn pua mih khin khe, ‘Amnawn kowi saita bowt,’ padow ang natek enni kown. Nakhowk khe aia kowi mih enni nasaita kown. Hang kram büa diah; nami dow ang ana pek iawng enni nachang kown mih chowtaih. Sakkraingma hai sakkhawtma hown uowiah büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Naiawng rakowi Absalawm kowh naruüa dow Absalawm ana pek iawng Amnawn kowi saita büah khai. Nahanow mang kowh chapauüa dow amatni chowlowkkow kowh kawrngaramchük luk kowi chowm hanow powt büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Amatni tiama rawng kowi chowreng tak khe David kowi maru uang tek pe mih, “En kowh chapauüa kowi Absalawm saita bowk khowk. Amatni dow lowk iachow paw sing uowi dowi bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Nami tata hanow mang David dow awr iowng khai, now aia dow sak piak rakowi aia kowh tawnguat thekah khai. Now aia dow krawng kowi iu tim kun khai. Aia kowh maru iukuüa maten paw amatni kowh tawnguat tawi thek büah hanow mang ria kowi iowngla rim khai.<verse eid="2SA 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Nachenganchepaw David kowh taimow Simea chapa Jonadab tek pe David mih, “Mangkri, en kowh chapauüa kowi Absalawm saita en bowk pami hangkow ka tuak diah. Aia saita mih dow Amnawn lowk iachow kowi taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng Amnawn kowi saita kown mih aia tuak mih dow atuamow Tamar kowi Amnawn piak pe siri mih ni hownia chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Naiawng rakowi aw mangkri, en kowh chapauüa kowng bowk khowk pami kowi hangkow sak piak diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kowng mih dow Amnawn lowk iachow taih,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Nami takra kowi Absalawm dow cham powt khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Jerusalem marow tap kowi kowh kangchawng mih dow krawi tang mü hanow hungh ria kowi kowh Horonaim pami tiama iawng maru kawmuüa uang haimang lawmlawm mih haikhita khai. Now nami lawnguan dow mang kowi aia kowtek pe khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Nakhowk khe Jonadab tek pe mang mih, “Pai iow, en kowh chapauüa uang mang khowk. Ang tek iawng uang phaw khai ni kowh!” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Naiawng aia ki tek hown akrowksang mang chapauüa dow uang towm hanow atün atünma uang kar büah khai. Now mang hai aia kowh maru iukuüa paw lainowmma tawi kar khai.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37-38" />Absalawm dow Amihud kowh chapa Talmai tut-e kowpowt khai, now nakowi Absalawm kowuowi sum ning khai. Amihud dow Gesur pami arah kowi kowh mang chekhai. Now mang David dow achapa Amnawn vüi ni towng uowila uiting uangtak khai. <verse eid="2SA 13:37-38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />David dow Absalawm hown natakrum kown mih lainowmma prüa khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Amnawn kowng mih rakowi aia sak kowi rau mih rim nown khowk chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi Absalawm uang plan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Zerui kowh chapa Joab dow Absalawm kowi mang David prüa mih nowm khowk pami tuk khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow kowchin maru hanow Tekoa marow kowi kowh prengia uowima mih masiuüa kowi uang hawla lowk ia khai. Nami masiuüa kowi Joab tek pe mih, “Uowila uiting uangtak khe kowh iawng chang diah; uowila uiting uangtak khe kowh tawnguat khup diah, now hang phawk unsi paingbawng diah. Kowng mih vüi uowila uiting uangtak mih akrama khowk mih masiuüa iawng chang diah. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Now mang tut-e kowkowiah hanow maiawngün laiklow maten kowtek diah,” pakhai. Joab dow nami masiuüa tawng chow nakowtek kown mih krawi sangah khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Nami masiuüa dow mang tut-e kowkowi hanow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se chupah khai. Now tek pe mang mih, “Aw mangkri, khowng ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Mang lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow en own?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Nami masiuüa klangah mih, “Ang dow mamaimow chekhai. Ang kowh dow hua kowng khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Ang kowh dow chapa uowi pre ia chowdiah. Akat khe amatchi dow dowm kowi takhüm iüah khai. Nakhowk khe amatchi kowi napraiah kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi atainau lowk ia dow alowk mih tainau kowi saita khai. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Kawmat dow krungchakuüa maten mih kingküa ang khai. Amatni tek ang mih, ‘En kowh chapa kowi anging rut kowi apta anging diah. Atainau kowi aia saita mih lu klai aia kowi anging nasaita kown,’ pah ang khai. Nahanow aia dow naka powng dawngthawnguan kown nadowi bowt. Naiawng hai amatni dow ang kowh sakowmra lowkchow mih kowi saita kown mih nau büah khai. Nahanow ang kowh hua ming hai aia kowh krungchak dow krawng luk hownia natama kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Nakhowk khe mang tek pe mih, “Kim kowi kowmang diah towbowt. En chapa kowi miapaw uang nowng sai dowi iawng ang mü en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Aw mangkri, en khowng ang rakowi maru tang en angak khai hanow nami angak srui dow ang hai apa kimchak luk kowi pacham kla lah. Nachenganchepaw en hai en kimchak kowh dow angak hang pacham uowi lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Mang tek pe mih, “Pachap dowi now pachap uang tek en mih maru kowi ang tut-e uang pawla diah. Nahanow aia dow tawng iawng mih laiklow paw natek en kown nadowi bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Mangkri, ang kowh chapa kowi lu klai pawk mih maru naia saila dowi kownkow sakrauma hai CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai ming hown kham sawi diah. Nadowi now lu klai pawk mih maru mih ang kowh chapa kowi nasaita kown chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Mang tek pe mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang takham khowk, en chapa kowh sam aiangchow khowm padow miapaw nauang ia kak kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Mangkri, sakrauma hown pe tek ang lai pakatchow diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Mang tek pe mih, “Tek bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Now tawngplawng kowchow Thurai maru-uüa kowi nachangah angak kownkow en tuk sangkrang khai? Naiawng en tek mih dow en matia kowi en tape angak mih chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en lawtta mih en kowh chapa kowi dow en tut-e en uang pe mangah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Krawng kowi khükta tui khowk hanow kaah avür dowi bowt. Nami iawng dow a-i paw kowng khowk hanow uang nowng plan sing dowi bowt chekhai. Kowng khowk mih kowi dow CHAKRAMANG khowm padow plan pe singah dowi bowt chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en lawtta mih maru kowi dow en tut-e en uang plan ia pawla iawk chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Mangkri, mami laiklow ang uang tek en mih dow maru krawk ang kowh chekhai. Ang uang tek en now ang tek en iawng en nachang ang ün tarawng padow ang ka tuak khai. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Now CHAKRAMANG pe anging mih pren hownia ang hai ang kowh chapa kowi namata kown nau mih maru rut hownia en nalawng ang ün tarawng padow ang ka tuak khai. <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Mangkri, en nape ang thaulangra kown mih ang ka tuak chowdiah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow aiung angak lawnguan kowi Thurai kowh kramamu iawng tuk chekhai. CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow en tut-e pacham tawi uowi reng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa kowi mang tek pe mih, “Ang nalünta en laiklow lowk kown. Nami dow achingma tek ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Mangkri, tek bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Mang lüntaah mih, “Naiawng en uang chang mih Joab uang pe chang en kowh bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Nami masiuüa klangah mih, “Mangkri, en sak lüklau hown ang tek khowk, en tek mih na chow. Ow, maiawng ang chang mih dow Joab tek ang kowh chowtaih, now maiawngün laiklow nauang tek kown mih paw aia sang ang kowh chowtaih. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Naiawng Joab chang mih dow nami lawnguan mih asar hown en pacham tuak lah pakowh chekhai. En dow Thurai kowh kramamu iawng prengia uowima chekhai. En dow pren kowi tawng chow own mih own dowi mih en tuk bowk chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Akung kowi dow mang mih kowchin maru hanow Joab kowi uang hawla khai. Now tek pe Joab mih, “Iung chow. En tek iawng ang chang kown towbowt. Kowkowi hanow Absalawm klanguüa kowi uang pawla bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Now Joab dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se mang kowi chupah khai. Now tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri, CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe en prasi lah. Ang kowh laiklow dow enni chün ang khai. Naiawng rakowi en saksing sana ang mih dow ani ang tuk khai bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Nami kung kowi dow Joab mih Gesur pren kowi kowkowi khai, now Absalawm kowi mih Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Nachenganchepaw mang tek pe mih, “Aia dow aiamat kim kowi pacham kowi lah. Ang pur kowi aia mih hang pacham uang lah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Absalawm dow aiamat kim kowi kowuowi khai; a-pa kim kowi kowkowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">David hai Absalawm iüah pachow plan taiung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Absalawm dow klangiungma chekhai. Aia kowh dow lunui hownia khawkpha mowr tawng iawng mih amün ama uowi dowi chekhai. Aia iawng mih dow Israel pren paprenma kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow maru lang kiowah khai. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Aia kowh dow sam huma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia kep sam mih dow paning kowi pakatchow taih. Naiawng aia kepta mih dow di lai bowt kowh chowtaih chekhai. Naiawngün aia kepta mih sam dow khaiah hanow adik pre set hown akhuai chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Absalawm kowh dow chapa uowi sum ia, now chama uowi lowk ia chekhai. Achama ming dow Tamar. Aia dow klangiungma chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Jerusalem marow kowi Absalawm uowi mih dow pre ning khowk. Nachenganchepaw aia dow mang kowi ka khi dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Now Absalawm mih mang tut-e nape kowiah kownkow Joab kowi nakowhaw kown mih kowchin maru khai. Nachenganchepaw Joab dow Absalawm tut-e uang kown mih nau pe dowi chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Absalawm mih Joab kowi nakowhaw kownkow kowplan chin maru khai iawk. Tawkche nami leng paw Joab dow aia tut-e uang kown mih nau pe dowi iawk chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh naruüa kowi Absalawm tek pe mih, “Sünta büa diah, Joab kowh laih dow ang kowh laih ria kowi taih. Aia dow iakmow paw sawtta khowk. Enni mih laih kowi kowkowiah hanow kowtowk pe diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Absalawm kowh naruüa dow Joab kowh laih kowi kowkowiah hanow kowtowk pe khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Nakhowk khe dow Joab mih Absalawm kim kowi kowkowiah hanow kowtek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en kowh naruüa uang tuk towk ang laih khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Absalawm klangah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow panow nauang haw en kownkow ang uang chin en maru khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e en uang dowi chekhai. Nami khin khe en uang e dow mang tut-e ang kowchin en kown mih chowdiah. Now, ‘Nakowi uowi phülü mih ang vüi lang iung rowt tak chowdiah. Aia che khi ang kown nau dowi hanow Gesur pren hownia uang pawla ang mih tawngplawng kowchow?’ pami laiklow nakowpe lünta en kown chowdiah. Kawmat mih apa kowi ka khi iawng en chang ang diah. Ang kowh che angak uowi khai hanow aia mih pacham saita ang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Naiawng rakowi Joab dow mang tut-e kowkowiah hanow naiawngün laiklow maten tek pe khai. Naiawng rakowi achur kowi dow mang mih Absalawm kowi nauang hawla kownkow kowchin maru khai. Now Absalawm dow mang pur kowi uang hanow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se uang chupah khai. Nakhowk khe mang dow Absalawm kowi namah khai.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Absalawm kingküa David mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Akung kowi dow Absalawm mih aiamat vüi kawrnga kari hai kawrnga ün cham krawi paw khai. Now aia pur kowi narik mang kownkow aia mih maru iun 50 ia towah khai. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Absalawm dow rau towng murpa awr rü hanow Jerusalem marow tapplawt tiama ria kowi hawt iowng reng chekhai. Now mang tut-e nauang chet tara kownkow uang mih maru kowi Absalawm hawt hawah reng chekhai. Nami maru kowi aia hawt lüntaah mih, “Tawng mih marow hownia kowh maru chow en?” pakhai. Nami maru dow, “Ang dow Israel chenchap kowi kowh paimi krungchak maru taih” padow tek pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Nakhowk khe Absalawm hawt tek pe reng mih, “Sünta diah, ari aiang dow en prakowi tawi tangi chowdiah. Tawkche en kowh laiklow nahawt sünta en kown mih mang kowh maru uowi dowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Nami klen kowi Absalawm plan tek mih, “Pren kowi kowh tara chet miia ang chowng khai panü! Naiawng e dow nauang chet tara kownkow ang tut-e uang miuüa kowi tara nowm ang nahawt chet pe kown taih diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Now tabawk krawm se aia kowi maru uang chupah kown khe aia dow nami maru kowi hawt dawiah hanow nam pe awm reng chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Mang tut-e nauang chet tara kownkow uang mih Israeluüa maten kowi Absalawm dow naiawng hawt changah reng khai. Naiawng hown aia dow Israeluüa kowh sak mih aia prakowi hawt küng pe khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Naiawng phaw mih tali ning kung kowi dow Absalawm tek pe mang mih, “Sakrauma hown Hebrawn marow kowi pe kowi ang diah. Nakowi mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowh ang takhamta iawng ang nakowchang tak. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Siria pren kowi kowh Gesur süng kowi en kowh nar ang uowi reng tak khe CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang takham mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG che Jerusalem marow kowi plan pawla ang iawk hanow Hebrawn marow kowi aia vüi ang nachang pe phuchua pawi kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Mang krawi tek pe Absalawm mih, “Thaulangma hown kowkowi diah,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 15:9">Nahanow Absalawm dow Hebrawn marow kowi kowkowi khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10-12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10-12" />Aia dow Jerusalem marow hownia hawla maru 200 ia khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün maru-uüa dow nachang lup ngak kown mih tuak uowi dowi kowi kowtawi büah khai. Now Absalawm dow Hebrawn marow kowi kowting hanow chang phuchua khai. Nami khin khe Absalawm dow Gilo marow kowi kowh Ahithofel kowi nakowhaw kownkow kowchin maru khai. Ahithofel dow mang David kowh prengia pek mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 15:10-12">Naiawng hai Absalawm prakowi tangila mih maru dow uang kawm ngamlam chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Absalawm dow David kowi nakingküaah kown mih kür uang lang ka ngamlam khai. Now aia dow Israel krungchakuüa maten kowi mami laiklow nakrawi tek pe kownkow kukpa kowchin maru khai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, “Enni ta baw tün hown krowksang maiawng enni natek kown, ‘Kawmat dow Hebrawn marow kowi Absalawm mih Israel kowh mang chowbowt,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 15:10-12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow hownia David powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Nami kung kowi maru uang lowk ia hanow uang tek pe David mih, “Israeluüa mih Absalawm prakowi tawi tangi bowk khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Naiawng rakowi Jerusalem marow kowi kowh aia tut-e kowh tawi ta uowi mih maru iukuüa kowi David tek pe mih, “Chu, alenma a-i cham powt lah. Aia uang ting dowi rawn kawmat mat a-i cham powt diah sik. Nadowi now Absalawm rut hownia miapaw a-i nowng plai kown nadowi. Alenma uangah hanow aia mih nauang piakta a-i kown chowbowt, now marow kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi paw nasaita bowk kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Mang kowh maru iukuüa tek pe aia mih, “Mangkri, en tek iawng nachang kown mih anging nauta chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Now mang dow aia kimchakuüa hai aia kowh maru-uüa bowkbowk kowi pawla now lawt khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw aia changla masi mih narma hamüt ia kowi dow aia ta pe mingkhetah kim khai. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />David hai aia hown kowh tawi miuüa maten dow mang mang now marow rihi chur kowi kowh kim re-e kowiowng büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Mang dow aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi aia pur kowi pe rik mangah khai. Aia kowh kangchawng miuüa maten hai Gad marow hownia kowh mang kung uang tawi mih Gaduüa 600 ia kowi paw rik pe mangah khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Nakhowk khe Gaduüa kowh siphai aluchow Ittai kowi David tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow anging hown en uang tuk tawi khai? Kowplan now mang Absalawm tut-e kowtawi uowi diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow prenlang maru chekhai; en dow en matia pren hownia kowh en uang powt mih chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Israel pren kowi en uang tawi uowi mih dow kra dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi anging cham kowi rah kowi nacham pawla en kown mih taka dowi tak. Tawng kowi chow anging cham kowi kown mih ang matia khowm tuk dowi chekhai. En mih en prenchakuüa hown kowplan diah. CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowm mih rah dow en tut-e pacham uowi reng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Nachenganchepaw Ittai tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri, masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se hai en sak lüklau se ang takham khowk, sing chepaw, kowng chepaw en cham kowi rah kowi ang paw natawi kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />David tek pe mih, “Naiawng now uang tawi büah bowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Gat marow kowi kowh Ittai dow aia kowh maru-uüa hai amatni kowh kimchakuüa tut-e tawi khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />David hai aia kowh maru-uüa powt mih khita hanow pren kowi kowh maru-uüa dow atün atünma kar khai. Mang hai aia kowh maru maten dow Kidrawn lawngrawi klenla now süngrüp süngkangma prakowi haimang büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Now David hown uamow Zadawk hai uamow Abiathar iüah paw uang tawi khai. Nami klen kowi Leviuüa paw kawtla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla now uang tawi khai. Amatni dow marow hownia maru kawmuüa uang lawt bowk dowi mowr sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih thüpta hüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kowplan sata sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Akung kowi mang tek pe Zadawk mih, “Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow marow kowi kowplan pawla diah. CHAKRAMANG che sak-ih ang khai hanow aia mih nauang plan pawla ang iawk kown taih, now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hai aia kowh uowi rah dow naplan pe khi ang iawk kown taih. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Nachenganchepaw aia che sak-ih ang dowi hanow aia tut-e iung iawng pacham chang ang lah towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Nami klen kowi mang tek pe uamow Zadawk mih, “Abiathar enchi thaulangma marow kowi kowplan iüa diah. Now en kowh chapa Ahimaz kowi hai Abiathar kowh chapa Jonathan iüah kowi paw pawla iüa diah. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Enni hownia ang tut-e satang uang ting dowi mowr dow süngrüp süngkangma re-e kowh Jawrdan aw khawk hown nowng pownah mih arah kowi anging nahawt chawng kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Naiawng rakowi uamow Zadawk hai uamow Abiathar iüah dow pawla Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla now Jerusalem marow kowi kowplan khai. Now nakowi mih uowi iüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />David dow karla se Kanrawn hungh kowi awr pün khai. Aia dow uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla kownkow khula lu khai, now phanaikhawk paw kruala dowi chekhai. Aia hown tawi miuüa maten paw tawi khula lu hanow karla se hungh kowi tawi pün khai. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Nakhowk khe David kowi maru uang tek pe mih, “Nakingküa en kownkow Ahithofel paw Absalawm hown tawi tangi khai bowt,” pakhai. Nahanow chup Thurai se David tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, Ahithofel kowh prengia lai dow prengia ngak lai pacham phaw lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />David dow Kanrawn hungh chut kowi kowh maru kiow pe Thurai mih arah kowi kowtowm khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Arki krungchak Husai dow David hown uang takrum khai. Husai dow aia uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla kownkow atheknama mih tawnguat uang khupla khai, now lu kowi dow uang pruila dinchow khai. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />David tek pe Husai mih, “Ang hown en tawi chepaw tawngpaw en tawi nowng khowng ang kown nadowi. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Naiawng nadowi kowi marow kowi phai kowplan diah. Now Absalawm kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Aw mangkri, ang dow auown khe en pa kowh nar chekhai. Now kawmat dow en kowh nar ang nachowng kown towbowt,’ pape diah. Naiawng che en kowtek hanow Ahithofel kowh prengia lai dow en kownowng piakta pe kown taih. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Nakowi dow uamow Zadawk hai uamow Abiathar iüah mih natawi uowila en kown taih. Mang kim kowi kowh en taah mih maten kowiüah kowi en nauang tek pe kown. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Now Zadawk kowh chapa Ahimaz hai Abiathar kowh chapa Jonathan iüah paw nakowi uowi chekhai. En taah mih maten nauang tek ang kownkow kowiüah kowi en nauang chin ang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Naiawng rakowi David kowh auiua Husai dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowkowi khai. Nami khin khe Absalawm paw Jerusalem marow kowi uang ting khai.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">David kowi Ziba peah chakkham mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Akung kowi David dow Kanrawn hungh chut hownia iu dowm adungchow now Mefiboset kowh nar Ziba hown takrum khai. Ziba tut-e dow dau pe uan mih kawrngaramchük uowi pre pum chekhai. Now nami kawrngaramchük luk kowi dow kawm 200 pah, grep uih keu 100 pawt, uidut uih 100 pawt hai grep tui mih chak pik im kowi pa-im uowi khai. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Ziba kowi mang lüntaah mih, “Naiawngün en uang pawla mih tawng auan kowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Ziba klangah mih, “Kawrngaramchük pre pum mih dow en hai en kimchakuüa nachowmah kown mih vüi chekhai. Now kawmpah hai uidut uih dow klanguüa hawmh nachaah kown mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi grep tui dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh mang bowm miuüa nakhamah kown mih vüi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Mang lüntaah mih, “En kowh kim iah Sawl kowh chu Mefiboset tawng kowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Ziba klangah mih, “Aia dow Jerusalem marow kowi ta uowi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia mih, ‘Ani dow Israeluüa mih apa kowh mangra naplan peta ang kown towbowt,’ pahai ka tuak khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Nami laiklow tata hanow mang tek pe Ziba mih, “Mefiboset kowh uowi mih maten ang peta en mih chowbowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Ziba tek pe mih, “Mangkri, ang chup en. Sakrauma hown saksing sana ang reng diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowi Simei peah piati mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Bahurim marow re-e David uang ting mih khin khe maru lowk ia dow David kowi pela piati se nami marow hownia uang lawt khai. Aia dow Gera kowh chapa Simei chekhai, now aia dow Sawl hown pakrungchak sang chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />David hai aia kowh maru iukuüa pur pra kung prakowi dow siphai hawmh hai kangchawng miuüa maten uowi khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Simei dow David hai aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi huaklu hown haikuakah khai. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Aia dow David kowi peah piati se tek mih, “Powt! Powt! En sai sak mih maru! En maru ngak chekhai! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Sawl kimchakuüa maten kowi en saita mih rakowi CHAKRAMANG pe en ripra mih chowbowt. Sawl kowh mang chowm rah en khünta pe khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow nami mang chowm rah mih en chapa Absalawm kowi CHAKRAMANG peta khai bowt. Naiawng en ka ripra mih dow en sai maru sak rakowi chekhai!” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Nakhowk khe Zerui kowh chapa Abisai tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri, kui uak iawng asung uowi dowi mih maru tawngplawng kowchow tuk pe en piati khai? Kowpe kowi ang now aia kowh lu kowpe dung ang diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Nachenganchepaw Abisai hai atainau Joab iüah kowi mang tek pe mih, “Nami lawnguan kowi tawngpaw enchi tawi tuak kla dowi. Aia kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe kowh aia pe ang piati mih chekhai hanow aia kowi dow miapaw naia hangah kown nadowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Nakhowk khe Abisai hai aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi David tek pe mih, “Ang matia chapa khowm padow saita ang kown mih sangkrang khai. Nami maru ngam dow Benjamin krungchak taih mih nasaita ang kown mih tawng lang sangkrang rowt dowi chow? Aia pe ang piati mih dow CHAKRAMANG tek pe kowh chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia nau iawng pe uowiah diah, now pe peah piati diah. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh akawm akrat namü ang chepaw naia kown. Now ani kowh ang kaah mih piati takcha aia nape ang iungra chepaw naia kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Nami kung kowi dow David hai aia kowh maru-uüa mih plan tarowng mang khai. Now Simei paw David hown tatang klowk mih hungh ria iawng mang se David kowi pela piati khai. Now aia dow huaklu hown ün David kowi kuakla khai, now dinchow hown paw uetla khai. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />David hai aia kowh maru-uüa maten dow Jawrdan aw kowi kowting büah khai bowt. Amatni dow lainowmma bowm khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nakowi tanai khai.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Absalawm hai Husai iüah takrum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Absalawm hai Israeluüa maten dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang ting khai bowt. Amatni hown dow Ahithofel paw tawi uowi chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Nami khin khe David kowh auiua Arki krungchak Husai dow Absalawm tut-e kowkowi khai. Now aia tek pe Absalawm mih, “Mangkri dow chowngdawng sakklangma pacham sing uowi reng lah! Mangkri dow chowngdawng sakklangma pacham sing uowi reng lah!” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Husai kowi Absalawm lüntaah mih, “En kowh auiua David kowi en saksing sana mih krang naiawng chekhai bow? Tawngplawng kowchow en auiua hown en kowtawi dowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Husai klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG hai Israeluüa maten kloah mih mang kowh maru chowtaih ang nachowng kown. Now aia hown chowtaih ang natawi uowi kown. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Ang kim iah kowh chapa kowh lup che ang chang pe dowi now amia kowh lup tak chow ang nachang kown? En pa kowi ang chang pe lup iawng en kowi paw ang nachang en lup kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Absalawm kowi Ahithofel peah prengia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Akung kowi Absalawm tek pe Ahithofel mih, “Tawng chow anging nachang kown mih pe anging prengia diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahithofel klangah mih, “Natamingkhet mang kim kownkow aia changla masi mih narmauüa kowi en pa ta towla hamüt ia chekhai. Naiawngün masiuüa hown en kowtaphua taiua diah. Nahanow en pa pacham sui en lah pakowh naiawng en chang mih chekhai pami Israeluüa maten natuk kown towbowt. Now en tut-e kowh maru maten dow natawi tangila en bowk kown towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow mang kimluk anaima mih kowi Absalawm vüi khup pe tangbung lowk khai. Now Absalawm dow Israeluüa maten pur kowi nami tangbung lak kowi kowkup khai, now a-pa changla masi mih narma hawmh hown kowtaphua taiua khai.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Nami khin khe Ahithofel kowh prengia lai dow Thurai hownia kowh uang towm mih padow maru ka tuakah reng chekhai. David hai Absalawm iüah paw Ahithofel kowh prengia lai dow naiawng hai tawi tuak iüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Ahithofel kowh prengia Husai nauta pe dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Nami kung kowi dow Ahithofel plan tek pe Absalawm mih, “Pe rui ang maru iun 12,000 ia diah, now aiak mih David kowi pe krawi ang diah. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Aia bowm thüm khe aia kowi mih ang nakowsenah kown. Nahanow aia dow nakram kown, now aia tut-e uowi miuüa dow napowt bowk kown towbowt. Nakhowk khe dow mang lowk iachow kowi taih ang nasaiah kown. <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />Nahanow maru maten kowi dow en tut-e ang nauang pawla kown towbowt. Nakowngta kownkow en nau mih dow lowk iachow taih. Aia kowi ang kowngta hanow akeng miuüa maten dow pren kowi thaulangma nauowi kown taih,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Absalawm hai Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa dow Ahithofel kowh nami prengia mih nauta khai.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Nachenganchepaw Absalawm tek mih, “Arki krungchak Husai kowi uang hawla diah. Nami lawnguan kowi tawng chow aia tek kown mih a-i sünta pe madiah sik,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Husai uang ting khowk hanow Ahithofel kowh prengia lai dow Absalawm hawt tek pe khai. Now Husai kowi Absalawm lüntaah mih, “Ahithofel kowh prengia lawnguan kowi tawng chow en ka tuak? Aia tek iawng anging nachang kown bow? Nami prengia che en nauta dowi hanow pe anging prengia diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Husai tek pe Absalawm mih, “Khaleng kowh Ahithofel pe enni mih prengia tarapdow iung dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />En pa hai aia kowh maru-uüa dow tasen kiakma kangowh pami en aiawng tuk towbowt. Amatni dow kaurawng kowi kowh cham khün chah reng mih tawmma iawng kramra uowima chekhai. Nami klen kowi en pa dow tasen reng mih maru chekhai; aia dow aia kowh siphaiuüa tut-e natawi iak kown nadowi. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Aia dow puk kowi lah, akeng mih arah kowi lah kawmat mih nacham tapet bowt. Tasen uown prakowi en kowh siphaiuüa che kowng pre sum ia hanow nami satang ta miuüa natek kown mih, ‘Absalawm kowh siphai hawmh kowng sangrum khowk,’ napa kown. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Nakhowk khe dow akürma mih hai krangsi iawng sakkraingma mih en kowh siphai khowm padow kram kowh amawlawma nauowi kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en pa dow tasen kiakma, now aia tut-e kowh maru-uüa paw sakkraingma kangowh pami Israel maten tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />“Naiawng rakowi ang kowh prengia dow maiawng: Dan marow hownia Ber-Seba marow mowr mih Israeluüa maten kowi rik kuaah diah. Nahanow amatni dow sata pang kowi kowh sema nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng akawmma naown kown towbowt. Now naiawngün maru-uüa hown en phai kowsen diah. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Nahanow lowra kowi aia cham uowi chepaw aia kowi dow a-i nakrawi ka kown towbowt. Now a-i dow nang kla khe kowh iawng akawm srui aia kowi nasenah kown. Aia hai aia kowh maru-uüa kowi dow lowk iachow kowi paw a-i nape singah kown nadowi. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Aia che marow kowi cham powt khai hanow nami marow dow leng hown a-i khuowkah kown, now tabur pat a-i Israeluüa maten naküngah kown. Now nami marow dow huaklu lowkchow khowm ta dowh dowi iawng lawngrawi kowi a-i nauang küngla kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Absalawm hai Israeluüa maten tek mih, “Ahithofel kowh prengia lak-e Husai kowh prengia lang iung,” pakhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Absalawm luk kowi nauang pawla pe piakra kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow Ahithofel kowh aiungma mih prengia napiakta pe kown mih rik khowmta khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowi kowphowng pe satang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Nami kung kowi uamow Zadawk hai uamow Abiathar iüah kowi Husai tek pe mih, “Absalawm hai Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi Ahithofel peah prengia chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow ang plan peah prengia khai. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Enchi mih mami satang kawmat David kowi krawi phowng pe kown mih, ‘Süngrüp süngkangma re-e kowh Jawrdan aw khawk hown nowng pownah mih arah kowi hangkow iak büah tham bowt; aw paipra pown kowi enni napown kown takla. Nadowi now en hai en kowh maru-uüa nakowng bowk kown chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Nami khin khe Jonathan hai Ahimaz iüah dow En-Rogel pami arah kowi nata satang kownkow hawt chawng hüah chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatchi dow Jerusalem marow kowi maru nakhi-ah kown mih nau iüah dowi chekhai. Amatchi kowi dow narma lowk ia mih uang phowng pe satang reng chekhai. Now nami satang dow mang David kowi amatchi kowplan phowng pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Nachenganchepaw akat khe dow amatchi kowi mih klanguüa lowk ia khita khai. Now nami klanguüa dow Absalawm kowi kowtek pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Jonathan hai Ahimaz iüah dow nami hownia alenma powt iüah khai, now Bahurim marow kowi kowh maru lowk ia kim kowi kowkup iüah khai. Nami maru kowh viadawng kowi dow tuikuam uowi lowk chekhai. Now amatchi dow nami tuikuam lak kowi kowtapet iüah khai. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Now nami kim iah kowh masi dow tuikuam mowr kowi iu be pe uanchow khai, now nami uanchow luk kowi dow dia pe luprak khai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi tapet mih dow miapaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Absalawm kowh maru-uüa dow uangah hanow nami kim iah masi kowi lüntaah mih, “Ahimaz hai Jonathan iüah tawng kowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Nami masiuüa klangah mih, “Amatchi dow aw paipra pown kowi chowbowt,” pape khai. Now Absalawm kowh maru-uüa dow kowiüah kowi krawi ka cham dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan khai.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Maru-uüa powt kung kowi Ahimaz hai Jonathan iüah dow nami tuikuam hownia awr lawt khai bowt. Now amatchi dow David tut-e kowkowi khai. David hai aia kowh maru-uüa kowi nasaiah kownkow Absalawm sangkrang mih lawnguan dow David kowi lawp pe iüah khai. Now amatchi tek pe mih, “Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi alenma kowkowi büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Naiawng rakowi David hai aia kowh maru-uüa dow haiuown pown Jawrdan aw khai. Now amatni bowkbowk dow uar thowi dowi rawn Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowting büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahithofel taawk mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahithofel dow aia kowh prengia iawng Absalawm chang pe dowi mih tuk khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia dow kawrngaramchük luk kowi dau pe uan hanow marow kowi kowh aia kim kowi kowmang khai. Now aia kimchakuüa kowi aia kowh dawngthawnguan lawnguan tawng chow achang takla mih aia khowm bowkla pe khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow taawk khai. Now aia kowi dow a-pa kowh tadupra kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih Mahanaim marow kowi kowting khai bowt. Nami khin khe Absalawm dow Israeluüa maten hown Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowtowm khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Absalawm dow aia kowh siphai aluchow Joab takcha Amasa kowi towah khai. Amasa dow Ismael krungchak Jether kowh chapa chekhai. Now a-u dow Nahas kowh chama Abigail chekhai. Abigail hai Zerui iüah dow amachak chekhai. Zerui dow Joab kowh u chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Nami kung kowi dow Absalawm hai Israeluüa mih Gilead süng kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowi a-auiuauüa khowngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Mahanaim marow kowi David uang towm mih khin khe maru sum ia mih aia kowi uang khowngah khai. Lowk ia mih dow Amawnuüa kowh Rabba marow kowi kowh uowi mih Nahas kowh chapa Sobi chekhai. Alowk mih dow Lo-Debar marow kowi kowh uowi mih Amiel kowh chapa Makir chekhai. Now alowk mih dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Rogelim marow kowi uowi mih Barzilai chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28-29" />Amatni dow David hai aia kowh maru-uüa vüi phangbek, biatum hai bawn puh ün uang pawla pe khai. Nami klen kowi David hai aia kowh maru-uüa nachaah kownkow püm, iakmow, kawmdi, püm haiia, be nuk, daing, kuai tui, iawn tui, chia iawn tui bawi hai ruapur ün uang pawla pe büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow süngrüp süngkangma iawng uaimang mih lawi hawm sakkrai tui sakkrai hown amatni bowm khowk pami nami maru sum ia mih ka tuak khai.<verse eid="2SA 17:28-29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Cham tasen kownkow David kamrüt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Akung kowi dow David mih aia kowh siphai hawmh maten kowi kuaah khai. Now naiawngün siphaiuüa luk kowi dow 1,000 ia kowi lowk ia, 100 ia kowi lowk ia chi aia tow pe aluchow khai. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Aia dow siphaiuüa kowi changah sum thum khai. Nami sum thum kowi pathum mih luk kowi kowh aluchow dow Joab, alowk mih thum kowi kowh aluchow dow Abisai, now alowk mih thum kowi kowh aluchow dow Ittai kowi aia tow pe khai. Abisai dow Joab kowh tainau chekhai, now Ittai dow Gatuüa süng hownia kowh maru chekhai. Now amatni kowi dow mang mih cham chinah tasen khai. Nakhowk khe siphaiuüa kowi mang tek pe mih, “Ang paw enni hown natawi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Nachenganchepaw amatni tek pe mih, “Tasenra kowi en tawi lakke dowi tham. Anging powtta pe khai chepaw Absalawm kowh siphaiuüa nasak nga kown nadowi. Now saita anging dawnglang chepaw amatni dow nasak-ih kown nadowi. Amatni nau mih dow nasaita en kown mih chekhai. Amatni tut-e dow anging 10,000 ia lak-e en asung lang uowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi marow kowi ta uowi now en uai khowng anging mih nalang iung rowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4-6" />Mang klangah mih, “Enni tut-e iung iawng ang chang kown towbowt,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4-6">Now Joab, Abisai hai Ittai büah kowi mang peah ana mih, “Ang chapa Absalawm klanguüa kowi dow ang vüi kowi hangkow changah naklak büa diah,” pakhai. Absalawm lawnguan kowi naiawng siphai aluchowuüa kowi mang peah ana mih khin khe siphai hawmh dow tawi ta bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4-6">Now David kowh 1,000 ia hai 100 ia mih siphai thumchakuüa dow Absalawm thumchak kowi nakowsenah kownkow lawt khai bowt. Nami khin khe mang dow marow tapplawt re-e ta iowng khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:4-6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Absalawm kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7-8" />Nami ni dow Efraim süng kowi kaurawng kowi lainowmma tasen büah khai. David kowh siphaiuüa dow Absalawm kowh siphai 20,000 ia kowi saita khai. Absalawm kowh siphaiuüa dow tasen kowh kowng mih lak-e nami kaurawng kowi kowh kramra uowima mih chap hown kowng mih lang kawm chekhai. Naiawng hai David kowh siphaiuüa dow Absalawm kowh siphaiuüa kowi nowngta khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Tasen thüm khe Absalawm dow David kowh siphai hawmh hown uang takrum mowk khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aiukma mih sasua singh krüa iawng kawrnga hown iu powt khai. Nakhowk khe aia kowh lu dow nami singh mia bakka kowi takap khai. Now nami kawrnga dow chetta pe hanow aia dow tatar hüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />David kowh maru lowk ia dow nami khita hanow kowtek pe Joab mih, “Sasua singh kowi Absalawm tatar hüah mih ang khi,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Nami maru kowi Joab tek pe mih, “Absalawm kowi en khi ah? Naiawng en khi khowk now tawngplawng kowchow aia kowi en saita dowi? Aia kowi en saita e dow tai hamüt iun hai tasen müa kekawm lowk ang pe en kown chowdiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Nami maru klangah mih, “En pe ang tai 1,000 iun chepaw mang kowh chapa kowi ang saiah dowi tham. Aia kowh chapa Absalawm kowi nachangah naklak dowi kownkow en kowi, Abisai kowi hai Ittai kowi mang pe enni ana mih anging ta bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Mang kaah sakowm dowi iawng aia kowh chapa Absalawm kowi ang saita pe khai e dow nami lawnguan mang mih natuk ngengche kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tut-e dow tawngpaw nowngia ta-it dowi chekhai. Now nakhowk khe dow en paw natawi tangila ang kown nadowi tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Joab tek pe mih, “En hown iawm khin kown ang nau dowi chekhai,” pakhai. Now Joab dow pawla reh sum pung hanow Absalawm sakmowr kowi kowsawtah khai. Nakhowk khe paw Absalawm dow sasua singh kowi tatar kawlaw tawkche kowng dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Nami kung kowi Joab kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng uai mih siphai hamüt ia dow Absalawm kowi rumta lut khai, now amatni dow aia kowi sawtah hanow kowngta khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Nami kung kowi dow Joab mih nataingta tasen bowt kownkow tum baw khai. Naiawng rakowi siphai hawmh dow Absalawm kowh siphaiuüa kowi kawikrawi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Now amatni dow Absalawm kowh uak mih kaurawng kowi kowh kuam iukma mih kowi kowkuakah khai. Now nami luk kowi dow cham kua pe hua hanow hua chun aiukma thawp pe lowk khai. Nami takra kowi Absalawm kowh Israel siphaiuüa dow chowlowkkow kim prakowi powt büah khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Absalawm dow aia sing uowi reng tak khe Mang Lawngrawi kowi aiamat vüi chowk hua lowk khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tek mih, “Nata town ang ming kown mih ang kowh dow lowk iachow paw chapa uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami hua kowi mih aia kowh ming chap pe khai. Kawmat paw nami chowkah mih hua kowi Absalawm kowh hua chowk padow maru tek pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">David uowila uiting uangtak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Nami kung kowi uamow Zadawk kowh chapa Ahimaz tek pe Joab mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow David kowi mih ransu-uüa rut hownia lawngah khai bowt pami satang iung David tut-e kowpe tek ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Joab tek pe mih, “Aia kowh chapa kowng khai chedow ani mih tawng iawng mih satang iung paw David kowi hangkow tek pe diah. Akeng mih ni khe kowtek pe iang,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Nami kung kowi Ethiawpia chenchap maru lowk ia kowi Joab tek pe mih, “En khi-ah mih maten mang kowi kowtek pe diah,” pakhai. Nahanow nami maru dow Joab kowi chupla hanow kowiowm khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ahimaz plan tek pe Joab mih, “Lowra iawng pana lah. Sakrauma hown nami maru kung kowi pe kowi ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Joab klangah mih, “Pa, en kowtawi kown en nau mih tawng rakowi chow? En nakala awmrawm sung pat mih satang iung dow en kowh uowi dowi kowbow,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ahimaz tek pe mih, “Lowra iawng pana lah. Pe kowi ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Nakhowk khe Joab tek pe mih, “Kowkowi bowt,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Ahimaz dow Jawrdan lawngrawi iawng kowkrawi iowm khai. Now Ethiawpia chenchap maru kowi kowkrawi ia owtta khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Nami khin khe David dow marow lak pra kowh tapplawt hai marow uat pra kowh tapplawt takra kowi chowm phülü khai. Now aia kowh kangchawng mih dow tapplawt luk kowi kowpün khai. Nakhowk khe kangchawng mih dow prang prakowi krawi tang mü hanow maru uai iowm lowk ia mih haikhita khai. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Now kangchawng mih dow mang kowi atünma iu hawah hanow nami lawnguan tek pe khai. Mang tek pe mih, “Maru che lowk iachow taih hanow uang pawla satang iung mih chowbowt,” pape khai. Now nami maru dow uang tatawn ngamlam khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Nami kung kowi kangchawng mih dow maru uang plan iowm lowk ia mih plan khi khai iawk. Nakhowk khe aia dow marow tapplawt chawng mih maru kowi atünma iu hawah hanow tek pe mih, “Haimü madiah! Maru uang iowm lowk ia iawk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Mang tek pe mih, “Nami paw uang pawla satang iung mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Nakhowk khe kangchawng mih maru tek mih, “Uai rik iowm mih dow uamow Zadawk kowh chapa Ahimaz kowh iowm powmma kowbow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Mang tek mih, “Aia dow maru iungma chekhai. Aia dow uang pawla satang iung mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Ahimaz dow mang kowi atünma hawah se tek pe mih, “Taking tasangra pauowi lah,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi aia dow mang pur kowi krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se chupah khai. Now tek pe mih, “Mangkri, CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Aia dow kingküa en mih maru-uüa kowi anging rut kowi apta anging khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Aia kowi mang lüntaah mih, “Absalawm klanguüa dow iung reng tak bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahimaz klangah mih, “En tut-e Joab uang chin ang mih khin khe maru kawmuüa lainowmma pusa mih ang khila khai. Nachenganchepaw tawng chow own mih ang tuk dowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Mang tek pe mih, “En cham lang süt ditchow diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Ahimaz dow lang süt hanow cham lang iowng khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Nami kung kowi nami Ethiawpia chenchap maru dow kowting hanow tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri, en vüi ang uang pawla en satang iung mih chowbowt. Kingküa en miuüa rut hownia CHAKRAMANG mih ani dow lawng en khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Nami Ethiawpia chenchap maru kowi mang lüntaah mih, “Absalawm klanguüa dow iung reng tak bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Nami maru tek pe mih, “Mangkri, en kowh ransu-uüa hai kingküa en miuüa maten dow Absalawm iawng pacham phaw lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Nami tata hanow mang dow lainowmma sak nga khai. Aia dow tapplawt luk kowi kowh kim kowi kowpün hanow kowkar khai. Aia dow awr pün khe karla se tekla mih, “Aw ang chapa Absalawm! Ang chapa Absalawm! En takcha ang che kowng khai panü! Aw Absalawm, ang chapa, ang chapa!” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Mang David kowi Joab nangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Akung kowi Absalawm vüi kowi mang kar mih hai uowila uiting uangtak mih lawnguan dow Joab kowi maru uang tek pe khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Nami ni dow David kowh siphaiuüa tasen awng mih ni chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw achapa vüi mang uowila uiting uangtak mih satang tata hanow siphaiuüa mih sak nga khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Amatni dow tasenra hownia atawmpa rukrai hown uang powt mih maru-uüa iawng nami ni mih kukpa kukpa marow kowi uang kup büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Mang dow aia kowh rut hown pumta lumowr hanow atün atünma kar hulu se tek mih, “Aw ang chapa Absalawm! Aw Absalawm, ang chapa, ang chapa!” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Nakhowk khe Joab dow mang kim kowi kowkowiah hanow tek pe mang mih, “En kowh siphaiuüa mih en, en kowh chauüa, en kowh masi hai en changla masi mih narmauüa kowi lawng enni khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow ani mih en peah rukrai khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Sui en miuüa kowi en sakrauah khai, now sakrau en miuüa kowi dow en suiah khai. En kowh siphai aluchow hai en kowh siphaiuüa dow en tut-e tawngpaw nadowi pami ani achima en tüng ang khai bowt. Ani anging kowng bowk chepaw Absalawm che ta sing khai e dow en naawmrawm kown chowdiah. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih prang kowi kowlawt hanow en kowh maru-uüa kowi kowtek pe awmrawm lai diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang tekta khowk, en che en kowh maru-uüa tut-e kowkowi dowi hanow aiak mih amiapaw en tut-e nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Nami dow asowmchow hownia kawmat mowr kowi kowh en krumla mih phih lak-e en vüi nalang iuk kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Naiawng rakowi mang dow awr rü hanow Mahanaim marow tapplawt kowi kowchowm khai. Nahanow maru kawmuüa dow mang tut-e uang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:8">Jerusalem marow kowi David uang plan mih</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Nami takra kowi Absalawm kowh Israel siphaiuüa dow chowlowkkow kim prakowi powt büah bowk khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Israel krungchak maru-uüa maten dow taüa lawmlawm se tatek mih, “Ransu-uüa hai Filistinuüa rut hownia kowh lawng a-i mih dow mang David chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow aia mih Absalawm rakowi Israel pren hownia cham powt khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />A-i luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow a-i nümnapah mih Absalawm mang dow tasenra kowi kowng khai bowt. Naiawng e mang David kowi naplan haw kown mih lawnguan kowi tawngpaw enni tek dowi kowbow?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Israeluüa tatek mih lawnguan dow mang David ta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia dow uamow Zadawk hai uamow Abiathar kowi Juda krungchak lawngtang aluchowuüa tut-e mami laiklow nakowtek pe kownkow kowchinah khai, “Israeluüa dow ang chowng mang mih nauta khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow enni dow ang kim kowi nauang plan pawla ang kown mih kowi enni kra reng tak? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Enni dow ang kowh tainau chekhai, now ang hown pabuk panga chak chekhai. Nachenganchepaw tawngplawng kowchow enni dow ang kim kowi nauang plan pawla ang kown mih kowi enni kra reng tak? <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Now Amasa kowi paw mami ang kowh laiklow enchi kowtek pe kown mih, ‘Achi dow pakimchak maru chekhai. Kawmat hownia Joab takcha en kowi che siphai aluchow ang tow en dowi hanow Thurai mih akraingma pacham pe ang ripra lah,’ pape diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Naiawng hown David dow Juda krungchakuüa kowh saktuak mih klowita pe khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow mang kowi krawi tek pe mih, “En hai en kowh maru iukuüa maten hown uang plan diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Naiawng rakowi mang dow Jerusalem marow kowi nauang plan kownkow tarowng mang khai bowt. Now Juda krungchakuüa dow Jawrdan aw kowi mang kowi napownla kownkow Gilgal marow kowi uang rik uang büah khai. Naiawng rakowi Jawrdan aw re-e mang uang ting mih khin khe amatni dow aia hown uang takrum khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Nakhowk khe Simei dow Bahurim arah hownia alenma uang hanow mang David hown nauang tawi takrum kownkow Juda krungchak maru-uüa hown uang tawi khai. Simei dow Benjamin krungchak Gera kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Simei hown dow Benjamin krungchak maru-uüa uang tawi 1,000 ia khai. Now Sawl kimchak kowh nar Ziba paw uang tawi khai. Nami klen kowi aia kowh chapa laitanga ia hai aia kowh nar pirmi ia paw uang tawi khai. Amatni dow Jawrdan aw kowi David hown uang takrum khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Amatni dow mang low iawng nachang kownkow hai mang kimchakuüa bowkbowk kowi nauang pawla kownkow haipown Jawrdan aw khai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:18">Simei kowi David saksing sanaah mih</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Mang haipown Jawrdan aw kown chowbowt mih khin khe Simei dow mang pur kowi uang tabawk krawm khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Now tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri, sakrauma hown ang kowh angak lawtta ang diah. Jerusalem marow hownia en lawt khe kowh ang changta mih angak hangkow tuak ang diah. Nami dow en sak kowi mapaw hangkow towah diah. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Ang changta angak mih dow ang tuk khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Josef krungchakuüa maten hownia ang kowh mangkri hown nauang rik takrum kownkow ani mih ang uang rik uang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Nakhowk khe Zerui kowh chapa Abisai tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG nümnapah mih mang kowi pe piati khai rakowi Simei kowi dow nakowngta kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Nachenganchepaw Abisai hai atainau Joab iüah kowi David tek pe mih, “Nami lawnguan kowi tawngpaw enchi tawi tuak takla dowi. Ani mih tawngplawng kowchow enchi tuk kingküa ang khai? Ani dow mia iawng mih Israeluüa maru kowi paw naia sai kown nadowi. Ani dow Israel pren mang ang chowbowt,” pape khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Nami kung kowi takham se David tek pe Simei mih, “En kowi dow nakowngta en kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mefiboset kowi David saksing sanaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Nami kung kowi Sawl kowh chu Mefiboset dow mang hown nauang takrum kownkow Jerusalem hownia uang iu dowm khai. Jerusalem marow kowi aiungma David uang plan dowi mowr aia dow aia kowh khawk ün mingkhet dowi, mawmpawi ün khai dowi, now tawnguat paw chu dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Now Jerusalem marow kowi David uang ting mih khin khe dow Mefiboset mih David hown uang takrum khai. Nakhowk khe aia kowi mang lüntaah mih, “Mefiboset, tawngplawng kowchow ang hown en tawi dowi da?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mefiboset klangah mih, “Mangkri, ang kowh dow klowng baima chekhai pami en tuk. Jerusalem marow kowi en kowkowi kown mih satang ang ta hanow ang kowh nar Ziba kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Mang tut-e ang natawi kownkow ang kowh kawrngaramchük luk kowi dau pe uan diah,’ ang pakhai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow powtta ang khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Aia dow mangkri tut-e ang uang kown nau dowi pahai uang küa dai khai. Nachenganchepaw mangkri dow aiung angak lawnguan kowi Thurai kowh kramamu iawng tuk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en tut-e iung iawng chang ang taih. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Apa kowh pa Sawl kowh krungchakuüa maten dow mangkri tut-e kowng kown mih tataing chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw en dow en kowh pawitang kowi natawi taiua cha chakkham kown mih alow en pe ang khai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh dow mangkri tut-e natekah kown mih tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Mang klangah mih, “Tawngpaw en atek lakke dowi bowt. Sawl kowh dawngthawnguan dow Ziba enchi mih taretah iüah towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Nakhowk khe Mefiboset tek pe mang mih, “Uowi mih maten dow Ziba pacham pawla towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh awmrawmra dow aiungma mangkri uang nowng plan mang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Barzilai kowi David saksing sanaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Now Gilead süng kowi kowh Rogelim marow hownia kowh Barzilai dow David hown nauang takrum kownkow Jawrdan aw re-e uang khai. Now aia dow David hown haitaiua pown Jawrdan aw khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Barzilai dow lainowmma lawngtang khai bowt; aia dow 80 ning khowk chekhai. Now aia dow lainowmma kureng khai. Mahanaim marow kowi David uang uowi mih khin khe aia dow David kowi peah chakkham khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Mang tek pe Barzilai mih, “Ang hown uang tawi pown aw now Jerusalem marow kowi ang tut-e tawi uowi diah. Ang thum en sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Nachenganchepaw Barzilai tek pe mih, “Mangkri, ang dow mün ning paw sing dowi bowt tham. Naiawng rakowi Jerusalem marow kowi tawng chow ang natawi chang bowt kown? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Ang dow 80 ning chih khai bowt, now tawng chap paw ang tut-e awmrawmra uowi dowi bowt. Cham cha cham kham chepaw asowr ang tuk dowi bowt, now meng sarauüa kowh meng klow paw ang ta dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang dow en vüi kurdik nachowng kown chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Mangkri, ang dow en kowh saksing sanara naka kown mih tataing dowi. Naiawng rakowi ang dow en hown haitaiua pown Jawrdan aw krowngchow kown mih taih. <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Nami kung kowi dow ang kowh marow kowi pe plan ang diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi kowng hanow au apa iüah tadupra re-e natadup kown ang nau. Nachenganchepaw mow ang kowh chapa Kimham. Aia dow en hown pacham tawi pown Jawrdan aw lah. En tut-e iung iawng aia vüi kowi en nachang pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Mang tek pe mih, “Kimham mih ang hown natawi pown aw kown. Now aia vüi dow en nauah iawng ang nachang pe kown. Nami klen kowi en nau mih uowi khai tak hanow nami iawng ang nachang en kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Nami kung kowi David hai aia kowh maru-uüa maten dow haipown Jawrdan aw khai bowt. Now mang dow Barzilai kowi nam pe awm hanow peah prasi khai. Barzilai dow Jawrdan aw mapra pown kowi uai plan pown hanow kim prakowi mang khai. <verse eid="2SA 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Naiawng hai Juda krungchak maten hai Israeluüa dawnglang dow David kowi Jawrdan aw haipownla khai. Now David dow Kimham hown Gilgal marow kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa hai Israeluüa takingküa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Israeluüa maten dow mang tut-e uangah hanow tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow anging kowh tainau Judauüa kukpa uang tuk pawla en khai? Tawngplawng kowchow amatni kangowh chow en kowi, en kowh kimchakuüa kowi hai en kowh maru-uüa kowi haituk pownla enni Jawrdan aw khai?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Juda maru-uüa klangah mih, “Mang dow anging kowh tasin taken mih chekhai rakowi naiawng anging chang mih chowtaih. Tawngplawng kowchow enni tuk kunmarau khai? Mang hownia anging tawi ka chakkham khai bow? Aia pe anging awmrawm sung khai bow?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Israel maru-uüa tek pe mih, “Enni Juda maru-uüa hown David lang tasin taken tawkche aia luk kowi anging kowh alow lang hu. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging Israel dow hamüt chenchap chekhai. Naiawng chepaw tawngplawng kowchow enni tow anging asung dowi? Mangkri kowi nakowplan paw kown mih lawnguan anging nadowi bow rik tek?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Nachenganchepaw Juda maru-uüa kowh laiklow dow Israel maru-uüa kowh lak-e lang rang chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">David kowi Seba kingküaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Gilgal marow kowi Seba pami maru ngakma mih uowi lowk ia. Aia dow Benjamin krungchak Bikri kowh chapa chekhai. Aia dow tum baw hanow tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">“Jese kowh chapa David tut-e a-i kowh kakbak uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">aia hown dow tawng alow paw a-i kowh uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">Aw Israeluüa, chowlowkkow kim prakowi plan büah bowk towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa maten dow David kowi nuata hanow Seba kung tawi krawi büah khai. Nachenganchepaw Juda maru-uüa dow mang David tut-e ta uowi khai. Amatni dow Jawrdan aw hownia Jerusalem marow mowr David hown kowtawi khai.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Now David dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh aia kim kowi uang ting khai bowt. Now ta pe mingkhetah kim mih aia changla masi mih narma hamüt ia kowi dow akeng mih kim kowi aia cham lang towah khai. Now amatni naia powtla dowi kownkow aia tow pe achawng mih khai. Lakke takla mih maten dow amatni kowi aia pe pe reng khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni hown dow aia taphua taiua dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng hai amatni dow kowng dowi mowr mih mamaimow iawng nami kim kowi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Akung kowi mang tek pe Amasa mih, “Sum ni takra kowi Judauüa kowi ang tut-e uang hawla diah. Now en paw makowi tawi uowi diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Naiawng rakowi Amasa dow Judauüa kowi nakowhaw kownkow kowtarü khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw aia dow mang krawi tek pe mih khin kowi uang mang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Nakhowk khe mang tek pe Abisai mih, “Absalawm lak-e Bikri kowh chapa Seba mih kawmat nalang piak a-i kown chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh maru-uüa kowi pawla hanow aia kowi kowkawi krawi diah. Nadowi now aia dow tap uowi mih marow kowi nacham powtta a-i kown chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Nahanow Abisai dow Joab hai aia kowh maru-uüa, mang chawng miuüa, now tasen kiakma miuüa kowi pawla hanow nakawikrawi Seba kownkow Jerusalem marow hownia lawt khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Now amatni dow Gibeawn kowi kowh singku huamang re-e kowting hanow Amasa hown takrum büah khai. Nakhowk khe Joab dow tasen tawnguat khupma chekhai, now kekawm kowi dow akawp hown tapla saidawng khai. Amasa re-e kowting hanow Joab dow aia kowh saidawng mih krawng kowi dowta khai.<verse eid="2SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Joab tek pe Amasa mih, “Tainau, iung reng tak bow?” pakhai. Nami kung kowi aia dow Amasa kowi nam pe awm kownkow aia kowh hawmlawm rut hown awr dowk pe mawmpawi khai. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Nachenganchepaw lakuai rut prakowi Joab kowh saichow uowi lowk tak mih dow Amasa khi dowi chekhai. Now Joab dow nami saichow hown Amasa mu kowi haisawtah khai. Nahanow Amasa kowh ria dow uang tauai plawt khai. Aia dow hing kowng khai; aia kowi dow Joab plan sawtah dowi bowt chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Joab hai atainau Abisai iüah mih Seba kowi plan krawiah khai iawk.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Joab kowh maru lowk ia dow Amasa uak re-e iowng now tek mih, “Joab kowi sakrau mih hai David kowi tangila mih maru dow Joab kung tawi krawi diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Nakhowk khe Amasa kowh uak dow tiama dawnglang kowi vi hown talawk klut chekhai. Now Amasa uak re-e siphaiuüa uang tachun chuk mih dow Joab kowh maru khita khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Amasa uak mih tiama hownia dowm kowi iu küngla khai, now apowngchow uan hown aia mumah khai. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Nami kung kowi dow maru maten mih natawi krawi Bikri kowh chapa Seba kownkow Joab hown tawi khai.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Seba dow Israel krungchak maten kowh süng iawng panow Abel-Bet-Maka marow kowi kowkowi khai. Seba matia kowh krungchak Bikriuüa maten dow takua talawm hanow nami marow kowi uang kup khai, now Seba kowi kawikrawi büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Now Joab kowh maru-uüa paw nakowi Seba uowi mih tukta khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nami marow kowumta lut khai. Now tap hown aprem sang awr plu bawn büah khai. Nami kung kowi amatni dow nami bawn plu luk hownia uown bawp tap büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Nakhowk khe marow kowi kowh chanlaima mih masiuüa lowk ia dow maiawng hai atünma uai haw khai, “Sünta büa diah! Sünta büa diah! Joab kowi ang tut-e uai chin ang büa diah. Aia hown talawp kown ang nau,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Aia re-e Joab kowkowi mih khin khe nami masiuüa hawt lüntaah mih, “En chowbowt bow Joab?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Joab tek pe mih, “Ow, ang chowbowt Joab,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “En kowh narma laiklow sünta ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Joab klangah mih, “Sünta khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Achük alai khe dow maiawng maru tek reng, ‘En che ka prengia iung kown nau now Abel marow kowi kowkowi diah,’ pakhai. Naiawng hai maru kawmuüa dow chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Anging dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh taking tasangra uowima mih hai kaah sakowm mih maru-uüa chekhai. Nachenganchepaw tawngplawng kowchow Israeluüa kowh asung uowima mih marow napiakta kown mih en tuk nau khai? CHAKRAMANG kowh dawngthawnguan anging Israeluüa kowi tawngplawng kowchow namata kown mih en tuk sangkrang khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Joab klangah mih, “Nadowi iowh! Enni kowh marow namata kown mih hai napiakta kown mih mapaw ang nau dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Anging kowh sangkrangra dow naiawng nadowi. Efraim hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh Bikri chapa Seba dow mang David kowi kingküaah khai. Aia kowi che en ap ang khai hanow mami marow hownia ang napowt kown taih,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Aia kowh lu dow tap luk iawng anging nahai kuak en sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Nami kung kowi nami masiuüa dow marowchakuüa tut-e kowkowi hanow Joab kowi kowh aia peah mih prengia kowtekla pe khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Seba kowh lu dungta pe hanow marow tap luk iawng Joab kowi hawi kuak pe khai. Nami kung kowi dow marow hownia napowt bowt kownkow Joab mih tum baw khai. Nahanow aia kowh siphaiuüa dow chowlowkkow kim prakowi mang büah khai bowt. Now Joab dow Jerusalem marow kowi mang tut-e kowplan khai.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowh maru iukuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Joab dow Israel siphaiuüa maten kowh lang kri mih chekhai. Jehoiada chapa Benaia dow mang chawng mih kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoniram dow naruüa kowh aluchow chekhai. Ahilud kowh chapa Jehosafat dow mang kowh chownglawng lawnguan rui mih chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Seva dow mang kowh cha rui mih chekhai. Zadawk hai Abiathar iüah dow uamow chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Jair marow hownia kowh Ira paw David kowh uamow chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Gibeawnuüa kowi David pe pawah lu klai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />David chowm mang mih khin khe sum ning mowr <char style="w">khown</char> kuak khai. Naiawng rakowi David dow nami lawnguan CHAKRAMANG kowi awr lünta khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “Nami khown kuak mih dow Sawl hai aia kimchakuüa changta angak rakowi chekhai. Amatni kowh angak dow Gibeawnuüa kowi saita mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Gibeawnuüa dow Israel chenchap nadowi; amatni dow ta sing uowi mih Amawruüa chowtaih. Israeluüa dow amatni kowi napiakah dowi kownkow kham sawi khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Sawl dow Israeluüa hai Judauüa kowi tawi tangila khai rakowi Gideawnuüa kowi saita kown mih sangkrang khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:2">Mang dow Gibeawnuüa kowi hawah hanow amatni hown talawp khai. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Amatni kowi David lüntaah mih, “Enni vüi tawng chow ang nachang enni kown? CHAKRAMANG kowh dawngthawnguan Israeluüa kowi enni naia pela prasi kownkow tawng chow ang chang enni e anging kowh angak enni nalawtta anging kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Amatni tek pe mang mih, “Saul hai aia kimchakuüa hown kowh anging kowh taranra dow kuh hown lah, tai hown lah aiungma naia chetah kown mih nadowi chekhai. Now Israeluüa kowi anging nakowngta kown mih paw nadowi chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">David plan lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow ang nachang enni kown mih tek ang büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Amatni klangah mih, “Saul nau mih dow napiakta anging hanow Israeluüa pren hownia namata anging kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Naiawng rakowi aia krungchakuüa hownia kachakuüa ranit ia kowi anging rut kowi ap anging diah. Amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG lang kloah mih Sawl kowh Gibeah marow kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi anging naawkah kown,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Nakhowk khe mang tek pe mih, “Kowbüah kowi enni rut kowi ang ap enni sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Jonathan chapa Mefiboset kowi dow David pe plaiah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow David hai Sawl kowh chapa Jonathan iüah dow CHAKRAMANG ming lüklaula se kham sawi iüah khai. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Tawkche Sawl chapa Armoni hai Mefiboset iüah kowi dow David pawah khai. Kowiüah dow Aiah chama Rizpa hown kowh Sawl kaah mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi Sawl chama Merab kowh chapa tanga ia kowi paw aia pawah khai. Merab kowh hua dow Mehola marow kowi kowh Barzilai kowh chapa Adriel chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />David dow kowbüah ranit ia kowi mih Gibeawnuüa rut kowi ap pe khai. Now Gibeawnuüa dow nami maru-uüa kowi hungh luk kowi Thurai pur kowi awkah khai. Naiawng hai nami ranit ia kowi dow akrowksang saita bowk khai. Naiawng kowbüah kowi saita mih dow ning towng kowh iakmow ngen khin kowi uown ngen iakmow mih khin khe chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Nami kung kowi dow Rizpa mih achapa uak uowi rah re-e kowh hua luk kowi be sala uan hanow nakowi uowi khai. Now ni-e khe uakling uaber hai iak-e khe kaurawng uaramchak mih uak re-e nauang dowi kownkow aia hawt chawngah khai. Naiawng hai aia dow ning towng kowh luprak ngen khin hownia siadawng khin uang talen dowi mowr uak mih chawngah khai. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Naiawng Rizpa chawng uak mih lawnguan dow David kowi maru uang tek pe khai.<verse eid="2SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl hai aia kowh krungchakuüa kowi dupah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />Nami satang tata hanow David hai aia kowh maru-uüa dow Jabes marowchakuüa tut-e kowkowi khai, now Sawl hai Jonathan iüah pachowh kowh hut mih kowka cham khai. (Saul hai Jonathan iüah pachowh kowi Filistinuüa saiah mih dow Gilboa hungh kowi chekhai. Now amatchi kowh uak dow Bet-San marow dawnglang kowi tarah büah khai. Nakhowk khe Gilead süng kowi kowh Jabes marowchakuüa dow amatchi kowh uak mih uang kuta pe khai). <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Now Sawl hai Jonathan iüah pachowh kowh hut dow Jabes marow hownia David uang pawla khai. Nami klen kowi Gibeawnuüa saita mih maru ranit ia kowh hut paw David cham krawi kuala khai.<verse eid="2SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />David kowh maru-uüa dow Sawl kowh pa Kis tadupra kowi Sawl hai Jonathan iüah kowh hut mih kowdupah khai. Nami tadupra dow Benjamin krungchakuüa süng kowi kowh Zela marow kowi chekhai. Mang kowh maru-uüa dow mang David tek iawng chang bowk chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow pren vüi amatni awr lüah mih Thurai hawt sünta pe khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Refaimuüa kowi Israeluüa senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Filistinuüa hai Israeluüa mih plan tasen khai iawk. David hai aia kowh maru-uüa mih Filistinuüa hown kowtasen khai. Tasen tasen now David dow lainowmma bowm khai. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Nakhowk khe Refaim chenchap Isbi-Benawb mih David kowi nauang saita kownkow adik sum set mih kri reh uang pawla apung khai. Nami klen kowi saidawng sar paw uang pawla apung khai. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Nachenganchepaw Zerui kowh chapa Abisai mih David kowi uang khowngah khai. Aia dow nami Filistin maru kowi bawpah hanow kowngta khai. Nakhowk khe David kowi pe khamah sawi se aia kowh maru-uüa tek pe mih, “Tasenra kowi katpaw anging hown hauang tawi tham bowt. En dow Israeluüa kowh sakowmra chekhai. En che kowng khai hanow Israeluüa kowi natakruitown kown mih miapaw uowi dowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Nami kung kowi Filistinuüa hai Israeluüa mih Gawb marow kowi plan tasen khai iawk. Nami khin khe Hus chenchap Sibekai dow Refaim chenchap Saf kowi kowngta khai.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Akung kowi Filistinuüa hai Israeluüa mih Gawb marow kowi plan tasen khai iawk. Nami khin khe Bethlehem marow hownia kowh Jair chapa Elhanan mih Gat marow kowi kowh Goliat kowi saita khai. Goliat kowh reh dow atatma chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Akung kowi Filistinuüa hai Israeluüa mih Gat marow kowi plan tasen khai. Nami tasenra kowi dow aiuk akroma mih maru uowi lowk ia. Aia kowh dow rutprüm hai khawkprüm uowi taruk klüng chi chekhai. Aia dow Refaim chenchap chekhai. (Refaimuüa dow aiuk akroma panow bawlima kangowh chekhai). <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Nachenganchepaw Israel chenchap kowi aia khareah mih khin khe David tainau Simea kowh chapa Jonathan dow aia kowi kowngta khai.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Naiawngün tali ia mih Filistin siphaiuüa dow Gat marow kowi kowh uowi mih Refaim chenchap chekhai. Amatni kowi dow David hai aia kowh maru-uüa mih saita khai.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">David kiow Thurai mih meng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />David dow aia kowh ransu-uüa maten hownia hai Sawl hownia CHAKRAMANG lawngah mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG vüi maiawng tek meng khai:<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />“CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh Singku Huamang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:2">aia dow ang kowh tatung tanimra hai lawng miia chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Ang kowh Singku Huamang dow ang kowh Thurai chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">ang kowh tatung tanimra dow aia chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">En dow kawngma iawng hai lawng ang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim dow aia chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Aia dow ang kowh lawng miia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">maru ngakuüa hownia aia dow lawng ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />CHAKRAMANG kowi dow ang hawah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">now aia dow ang kowh ransu-uüa hownia lawng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:4">CHAKRAMANG dow akiow taing chekhai!<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />“Ang luk kowi dow tuilowng iawng kowngra uang ting khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">ang luk kowi dow tui lawt iawng piakra uang kla khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Kramra uowima mih kowngra dow umta ang lut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">kowngra dow chak ang leng khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Ang kla phih khe CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai kowi ang hawah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">nauang khowng ang kownkow aia tut-e ang awr kar awr nguk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Aia dow aia uowi rah hownia ang awr lüah mih hawt sünta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">ang kar ang nguk mih aia param kowi kowting khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />“Nakhowk khe lusa dow chür nukluk hai tahowng nurlur khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">mukuang kowi kowh achüng maten dow chür nukluk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:8">Naiawng phaw mih dow Thurai kunmarau rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Aia nakawng hownia dow maikhük awr towk iualua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">aia kowh nawr hownia dow piakla mih maih uang lawt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">aia nawr kowi kowh maivia dow awr lün khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />“Aia dow mukuang nitah lang hanow lusa kowi uang iu dowm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">aia khawk daw kowi dow uangnim iiuma chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Aia dow Cherup pami kramamu luk kowi chowm hanow uang iow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">aia dow li hown alenma uang iow khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Aia dow aiiu hown aia matia kowi petah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">aia riaret kowi aiiuma mih uangnim dow tui kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Aia pur kowi dow anowi kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">nami anowi hown dow mairing hownia maih awr lün khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />“CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang hownia tüng klow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh klow dow taah chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Aia dow ransu-uüa kowi salangba hown ap-ah hanow cham uetta plawt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">amatni kowi dow pla nowi hown aia pe takrow takraiah khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />CHAKRAMANG dow ransu-uüa kowi nangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">aia dow nakawng hownia plawt kawli khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">Nahanow sata tui dow uang kang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">now lusa chüng maten dow uang tatüng khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />“Aia dow mukuang hownia iu iaw rut hanow iu dowk ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">tui büpma mih hownia dow aia uang khowngla ang khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Aia dow ang kowh akürma mih ransu-uüa hownia lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">aia dow sui ang miuüa hownia lawng ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang lak-e lang kür chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Ang kla phih khe amatni dow uang sen ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow uang khowng ang khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />“Aia dow aiungma mih arah kowi uang pawla ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">now ang luk kowi mih aia sak-ih khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:20">Naiawng rakowi aia lawng ang khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />“Ang kowh anowmma mih lup CHAKRAMANG chang ang aiung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">ang kowh tachi tanawmra rakowi aia dow pe ang awmrawm sung khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow CHAKRAMANG tiama kowi mang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">Thurai kowi kingküala mih angak dow ang chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Aia kowh ari aiang maten dow ang chün reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">aia kowh rirow hownia dow ang cham süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Aia pur kowi dow ang kowh angak uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">angak hownia ang lang tahen reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Ang kowh lup nowm rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow chang ang aiung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">ang kowh tachi tanawm mih rakowi aia dow pe ang awmrawm sung khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kaah sakowm miuüa kowi dow kaah sakowm iawng en chang pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">aiungma miuüa kowi dow aiungma en chang pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Achinawmma miuüa kowi dow <char style="w">achinawmma</char> en chang pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">kuanla miuüa kowi dow angakma en chang pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Khamsum khamdaw miuüa kowi dow en khowngah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">Nachenganchepaw bawrima miuüa kowi dow en müta hüah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">amatni kowi dow en piakah reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow ang kowh maibu chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">aiiu kowi ang uowi khe en tüng ang anowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />En kowh kür hown ransu siphaiuüa kowi ang nowng sen khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">ang kowh Thurai khowngra hownia amatni kowh tap kowklaw hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">alak kowi ang kownowng kup khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />“Thurai kowh tiama dow aser auowk uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">CHAKRAMANG kowh laikham dow aching pami uang tatüng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">Aia dow aia tut-e kowh uang tatung tanim miuüa vüi kawngma chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />CHAKRAMANG klen kowi dow akeng mih Thurai lang uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">a-i kowh Thurai klen kowi dow akeng mih singku huamang lang uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Thurai dow pe ang kür reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">aia dow ang kowh tiama mih aiungma chang ang khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Aia dow naki iawng alenma naiowmla kown mih kür pe ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">now alowngma mih hungma mawngma kowi thaulangma aia pe uowi ang khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Aia dow tawng iawng chow natasenah kown mih tüngsang ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">Naiawng rakowi kri hown kowh salangba mih ang nowng uüi khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en lawngla ang mih en kowh kawngma dow en pe ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">en khowng ang mih hownia kri kraingma ang phaw khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Ransu-uüa sen ang khe en khowng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">Naiawng rakowi ang tatheu dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />“Ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi kawikrawiah hanow ang saiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">amatni kowi ang saita dowi mowr ang plan kung dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Amatni kowi dow ang piakta naknak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">now amatni kowi dow ang sawtah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:39">Nahanow amatni dow ang khawk daw kowi tim büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">amatni dow hing nowng rü dowi bowt chekhai,<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Natasenla kown mih kür pe ang mih dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">ang ransu-uüa kowi dow ang khawk daw kowi en towah khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow ang hownia en prütah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">sui ang miuüa kowi dow ang piakta khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Amatni dow krawi lü akhowng mih khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow miapaw takhula dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:42">Amatni dow en tut-e awr lü khowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi en klangah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Amatni kowi dow dinchow iawng adima ang changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">amatni kowi dow tiama kowi kowh suplawk iawng ang thuata nak khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh maru-uüa kingküara hownia en lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">akeng chenchapuüa luk kowi aluchow en tow ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Akeng chenchapuüa khowm kawmat ang krüa kowi chang lup khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Prenlang maru-uüa dow ang kowh laiklow ta hown krowksang ang tek iawng chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">amatni dow ang pur kowi tabawk krawm se uang khamsum reng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Amatni kowh dow sakowmra uowi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">amatni dow chürla kluk se akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim hownia uang lawt khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />“En dow masing CHAKRAMANG chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">ang kowh Singku Huamang dow akiow pacham uowi lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:47">Thurai dow ang kowh lawng miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">en kowh ringkawra dow pacham hu lah.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />En dow ang vüi paw lu klai reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">akeng chenchapuüa kowi dow ang nimkrüa kowi en towah khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />En dow ransu-uüa rut hownia lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">chang ang nowng miuüa rut hownia paw en lawng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Ransu-uüa luk kowi dow en pe awng ang khai.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Naiawng rakowi aw CHAKRAMANG, akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi ang nakiow en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">en ming hown ang natek rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />En kowh mang kowi dow kri kraingma mih awngra en peah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">en nümnapah mih maru kowi dow achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng pe reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:51">David kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma en sakrauah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">aia krungchakuüa kowi paw chowngchowng saksakma en sakrauah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">David kowh achur laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Jese kowh chapa David kowi dow kri kraingma Thurai changah khai. Aia kowi dow Jakawb kowh Thurai nümnapah khai. Now aia dow Israeluüa vüi klangiungma thawn pe meng reng chekhai. Mami dow David kowh achur laiklow chekhai:<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“CHAKRAMANG lümla dow tawng chow atek takla mih uang phuang ang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">ang tekah mih dow aia hownia kowh laiklow chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Israeluüa kowh Singku Huamang tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Lowra mih mang che maru kawmuüa kowi anowmma kruitown khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">now aia che Thurai kowi kram hai ringkawma hown kruitown khai hanow<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />aia dow rau-e kowh anowi iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">aia dow süng aw chimprowngchow khe kowh nowi iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">aia dow uang kung kowi kowh anowi tawk pluplup mih iawng chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />“Thurai dow ang kowh krungchakuüa kowi napeah prasi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">aia dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Aia kowh sangbowk laitawm dow napiak kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">aia kowh laikham dow taklowi kown nadowi tham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Ang nau mih dow maiawngün chekhai:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">Aia dow nakhowng ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">now aia dow ang changah mih nape phawah kown.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa dow chuh mung kowi kowh chuh iawng:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">Naiawngün kowi kak miuüa dow ka ngarau reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">now naiawngün kowi dow asung uowi dowi rakowi lauta now kuakta takla.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Naiawngün kowi dow lawngha uanh hown lah, reh hown lah kakah hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">naiawngün dow asaima natowkta kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Maiawngün dow David kowh tasen kiakma miuüa kowh ming chekhai. Lowk kowi dow Hakmawn krungchak hownia kowh Jasobeam chekhai. Aia dow Sum pami thum kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Aia dow pakat mih tasen kowi ransu-uüa 800 ia kowi aia kowh reh hown nowng kowngta khai.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Pre kowi dow Aho krungchak hownia kowh Dodo kowh chapa Eleazar chekhai. Aia paw tasen kiakma mih pungmadawng kowi kowh lowk ia chekhai. Akat khe Filistinuüa mih Israeluüa hown natasen kownkow takua talawm khai. Nakhowk khe Israel siphaiuüa dow powt bowk khai. Nachenganchepaw Eleazar hai David iüah dow Filistinuüa kowi hauah tasen khai. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Eleazar dow ta uowi hanow aia kowh rut uak dowi mowr Filistinuüa kowi senah khai. Now aia kowh dow rut uak lai bowt rakowi aia kowh rut mih saidawng hownia awr nowng krowng dowi bowt chekhai. Nami ni kowi CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma Eleazar kowi pe awngah khai. Ki tasen kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih ransu-uüa kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng krowngchow nauang paw kownkow uang plan uang khai.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Now sum kowi dow Harar marow hownia kowh Age chapa Samma chekhai. Akat khe Filistinuüa mih nauang piak daing khang kownkow Lehi marow kowi takua talawm khai. Nakhowk khe Israel siphaiuüa dow Filistinuüa hownia powt bowk khai. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Nachenganchepaw Samma dow nami daing khang dawnglang kowi iowngah hanow Filistinuüa kowi senah khai. Naiawng rakowi Filistinuüa dow daing khang mih nowng piak dowi chekhai. Nami ni dow CHAKRAMANG mih kri kraingma aia kowi pe awngah khai.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Süngkawm pami tasen kiakma mih thumchakuüa pungmadawng kowi nami sum ia mih maru dow ngen luprak mih khin khe David tut-e Adulam puk kowi uang khai. Nakhowk khe Filistin siphaiuüa dow Refaim lawngrawi kowi khup tangbung khai. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Nami khin khe David dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi uowi khai, now Filistin siphaiuüa dow Bethlehem marow kowi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="2SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Nami khin khe David dow lainowmma tui sakkrai khai. Naiawng rakowi aia tek pe mih, “Bethlehem marow tapplawt re-e kowh tuikuam hownia mia iawng mih chü kowpaw ang tui ditchow dit panü,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Naiawng rakowi tasen kiakma mih maru sum ia dow Filistin siphaiuüa kowi senla se Bethlehem marow tapplawt re-e kowh tuikuam kowi kowkowi khai. Now amatni dow nami hownia towngla tui hanow David tut-e uang pawla khai. Nachenganchepaw David dow nami tui kham dowi chekhai. Aia dow nami tui mih CHAKRAMANG kowi ap-ah mih iawng hai khükta khai. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Aia tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, mami tui mapaw ang kham dowi tham. Amatni dow singsing kowngkowng hown kowh mami tui uang pawla mih chekhai. Mami tui dow amatni kowh vi hown katsang chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi David mih nami tui kham kown mih nau dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Nami Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thumchak kowh lup dow naiawng chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Süngkawm pami tasen kiakma mih thum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Zerui chapa Joab kowh tainau Abisai dow Süngkawm pami thum kowi kowh tasen kiakma mih kowi kowh lang kri mih chekhai. Aia dow ransu-uüa 300 ia kowi aia kowh reh hown saita khai. Aia paw Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thumchakuüa iawng ming nang pawma chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Aia dow Süngkawm pami tasen kiakma mih thum kowi aming anang lang paw khai. Now aia dow nami thumchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thum kowi kowh maru nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Kabzel marow hownia kowh Jehoiada chapa Benaia dow tasen kiakma chekhai. Aia paw akraing akraingma mih lup chang khai. Aia dow Moab chenchap kowi kowh tasen kiakma mih siphai pre ia kowi kowngta khai. Akat khe paw nangkhe kla mih khin khe aia dow krangsi kuam kowi kowdowm hanow kowkowngta krangsi apum khai. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Nami klen kowi Aigupta pren hownia kowh aiuk akroma mih maru kowi paw aia saita khai. Nami maru rut kowi dow reh uowi apung chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Benaia tut-e dow singh klowk adungchow klen kowi tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. Aia dow nami Aigupta maru kowi rupta pe reh hanow nami reh hown saiah khai. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Naiawngün dow Benaia changah mih lup chekhai. Aia dow Sum pami tasen kiakma mih iawng aming anang uowima chekhai. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Aia dow Süngkawm pami tasen kiakma mih thum kowi kowh maru chekhai. Nami thumchak kowi dow aia kowi maru lang peah ringkawra khai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thum kowi kowh maru nadowi chekhai. David mih aia kowi dow aia kowh kangchawng miuüa kowh aluchow thawpah khai.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Süngkawm pami tasen kiakma mih thum kowi kowh maru-uüa dow Joab kowh tainau Asahel, Bethlehem hownia kowh Dodo chapa Elhanan, <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Harawd hownia kowh Samma, Harawd hownia kowh Elika, <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Pelet hownia kowh Helez, Tekoa hownia kowh Ikes chapa Ira, <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Anathawt hownia kowh Abiezer, Husa hownia kowh Mebuai, <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Aho hownia kowh Zalmawn, Netofa hownia kowh Maharai, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Netofa hownia kowh Bana chapa Heled, Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh Gibeah hownia kowh Ribai chapa Ittai, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Pirathawn hownia kowh Benaia, Gas hungh re-e kowh lawngrawi hownia Hurai, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Araba hownia kowh Abialbawn, Bahurim hownia kowh Azmavet, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Salbawn hownia kowh Eliaba, Jasen kowh chapauüa, Jonathan, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Harar hownia kowh Sama, Harar hownia kowh Sarar chapa Ahiam, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Maka hownia kowh Ahasbai chapa Elifelet, Gilo hownia kowh Ahithofel chapa Eliam, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Karmel hownia kowh Hezro, Arba hownia kowh Parai, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Zoba hownia Nathan chapa Igal, Gad hownia kowh Bani, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Amawn hownia kowh Zelek, Joab kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng dowk mih Berawt hownia kowh Naharai, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Jattir hownia kowh Ira, Jattir hownia kowh Gareb, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />now Betseba kowh hua Hit chenchap Uria chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow bowkbowk kowi 37 ia chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">David rüa Israeluüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Akat khe CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa kowi lainowmma plan kunmarauah khai. Aia dow amatni kowi natowkah kawm kownkow David kowi tawngah khai. Aia tek pe David mih, “Kowkowi now Israeluüa hai Judauüa kowi kowrüa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Naiawng rakowi Joab hai aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi David tek pe mih, “Dan marow hownia Ber-Seba marow mowr mih Israel krungchak maru-uüa maten kowi kowkrawi rüa büa diah. Nahanow amatni kowh maru iun mut ang natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Nachenganchepaw Joab klangah mih, “Aw mangkri, CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow Israeluüa kowh maru iun mih kawmat kowh lak-e 100 phow mowr pacham huah lah, now nami dow en sing uowi reng tak khe aia pacham pe khi en lah. Nachenganchepaw naiawng mih lup nachang kown mih tawngplawng kowchow en tuk nau khai?” pape khai. <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Nachenganchepaw David dow Joab hai siphai aluchowuüa kowi aia kowh ana pe chünah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Israeluüa kowi nakrawi rüa kownkow mang pur hownia lawt büah khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Amatni dow haipown Jawrdan aw hanow mrawkphak pra kowh Aroer marow kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. Nami marow dow Gad krungchakuüa süng kowi kowh lawngrawi dawnglang kowi chekhai. Nami hownia dow tawngphak pra kowh Jazer marow kowi kowkowi büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow Gilead marow hai Hit chenchap uowiah mih Kades marow kowi kowkowi büah khai. Nami hownia dow Dan marow iawng kowtakui hanow satkup pra kowh Sidawn marow kowi kowkowi büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Nami kung kowi dow satlawt pra kowh tap uowi mih Sur marow, Hivuüa hai Kananuüa kowh marow maten kowi kowkowi büah khai. Now achur kowi dow Juda krungchakuüa uowiah mih mrawkphak pra kowh Ber-Seba kowi kowkowi büah khai. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Naiawng hai amatni dow paprenma kowi taku la hown 20 ni mowr krawi len khai. Nami kung kowi dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan büah khai bowt. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Joab dow tasen uang mih maru iun mut David kowi uang peah khai: Israel hownia dow 800,000 ia, now Juda hownia dow 500,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowi CHAKRAMANG ripah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Ki rüata maru kawmuüa kung kowi dow David mih aia kowh angak tatuk khai bowt. Aia tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “Naiawng ang rüa maru kawmuüa mih dow lainowmma ang changta angak mih chekhai. Aw CHAKRAMANG, sakrauma hown en nar ang kowh angak lawtta ang diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow abualama mih iawng ang changta lup khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Auai rau khe David kowh risi Gad kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“David tut-e kowkowi diah, now aia vüi ang khowmta pe sum chap mih ripra kowtek pe diah. Nami sum chap mih hownia aia pacham ruiah pachap lah. Now aia ruiah mih iawng aia kowi ang nachang pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Naiawng rakowi David tut-e Gad kowkowi now lüntaah mih, “Tawng mih chap chow en narui kown? En pren kowi ranit ning mowr khown nakuak kown mih bow? Dowdow ransu-uüa nakrawi en hanow sum la mowr en nacham powt kown mih bow? Dowdow sum ni mowr en pren kowi makowng hawi nauang kla kown mih bow? Kawmat mih paw tuak diah, now CHAKRAMANG kowi tawng chow ang nakowtek pe kown mih tek ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Nakhowk khe David tek pe Gad mih, “Ang kla phih mih chowbowt lowmow! Nachenganchepaw maru rut kowi dow taap kown ang nau dowi. CHAKRAMANG phai pacham rip anging lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh dow saksing sanara achur uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow nami rau hownia aia khowmta bowkta mih akhin mowr Israeluüa luk kowi uang chin pe makowng hawi khai. Nami hawi hown dow Dan marow hownia Ber-Seba mowr pren paprenma kowi 70,000 ia maru kowng khai. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Nachenganchepaw kramamu napiak Jerusalem marow kown chowbowt mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG mih maru kawmuüa kowi peah ripra mih lawnguan kowi planta saktuak khai. Now krawi piak maru mih kramamu kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Na khowk tak, taingta bowt diah,” pakhai. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu uowi mih dow Jebus chenchap Arauna kowh cha thuara re-e chekhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Krawi piak maru kawmuüa mih kramamu kowi khita hanow David tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “Changta angak mih hai tawita mata mih dow ang chowtaih. Naiawngün maru kawmuüa kowh dow aprek uowi dowi chekhai. Tawng chow amatni changta khai? Ang hai ang kimchakuüa kowi phai pe anging ripra diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">David thawp phuchuara mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Nami ni khe Gad dow David tut-e kowkowiah now tek pe mih, “Jebus chenchap Arauna kowh cha thuara kowi kowkowi diah, now nami re-e CHAKRAMANG vüi kowthawp phuchuara lowk diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Naiawng rakowi David dow Gad tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rowprowp nakowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Arauna dow krawi tang mü hanow aia prakowi David hai aia kowh maru iukuüa uaimang mih khita khai. Now aia dow kowkowiah hanow mang pur kowi krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se mang kowi chupah khai.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Arauna lüntaah mih, “Mangkri, en kowh nar ang tut-e en uang mih tawng rakowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">David klangah mih, “Ang uang mih dow en kowh cha thuara nauang ran kownkow chekhai. Now makowi mih CHAKRAMANG vüi ang nathawp phuchuara lowk kown. Nahanow maru kawmuüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG pe klaah mih makowng hawi nataing kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Arauna tek pe David mih, “Mangkri, en tut-e iung iawng paw hanow chang phuchua diah. Mow, nachangla tikah mih uanap kownkow phuchuaah kown mih chiala ün uowi chow. Now nachangla sawp kown mih vüi paw cha thua müa uanh hai laithawn tim ün uowi chow. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Aw mangkri, maiawngün dow ang peta en bowk mih chowbowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:23">Nami klen kowi Aruana plan tek pe David mih, “CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow en kowh uanap mih pacham awmrawm en lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Nachenganchepaw mang tek pe Arauna mih, “Naiawng e nadowi. Maiawngün dow asung hown ang naranah ngengche kown. Aiawng kaah mih uanh hown CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai vüi ang nachang tikah mih uanap kown nadowi,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Naiawng rakowi David dow nami cha thuara hai chiala ün tai 50 iun hown ranah khai. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih nakowi CHAKRAMANG vüi thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Now aia dow tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap chang khai. Naiawng rakowi pren vüi kowi kowh David awr lü mih dow CHAKRAMANG hawt sünta pe khai bowt, now Israel pren kowi kowh makowng hawi dow taing khai bowt.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>